(3091686, 434221, 64773, '<td valign="top">Great shot. It looks almost HDR like though? It''s funny, such a dominating structure in the background is completely dwarfed by the emotion coming out of the figure in the foreground. I wonder how more powerful this shot could have been if you lost the backpack, and had the person lie on the bench with their feet towards the lens? Maybe a newspaper of their body? I really like this shot! Best so far in the challenge shots I''ve looked at and voted on :-)</td>', 'Great shot. It looks almost HDR like though? It''s funny, such a dominating structure in the background is completely dwarfed by the emotion coming out of the figure in the foreground. I wonder how more powerful this shot could have been if you lost the backpack, and had the person lie on the bench with their feet towards the lens? Maybe a newspaper of their body? I really like this shot! Best so far in the challenge shots I''ve looked at and voted on :-)', '2006-12-06 05:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
