(3092720, 434973, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting take on the theme.  DoF isn''t quite working though, with the very OOF gravestones.</td>', 'interesting take on the theme.  DoF isn''t quite working though, with the very OOF gravestones.', '2006-12-06 12:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092723, 434170, 656, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a dress.</td>', 'That''s quite a dress.', '2006-12-06 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092726, 433797, 656, '<td valign="top">The window/ sun light is really harsh, somewhere a bit more shaded would have given maybe a better balance to the lighting.  Also taking a bit more care with the composition could have kept that background entirely seamless and cleaned up the top right/left corners.  Maybe even getting a bit closer in to capture just the face/ arms would further simplify the shot.</td>', 'The window/ sun light is really harsh, somewhere a bit more shaded would have given maybe a better balance to the lighting.  Also taking a bit more care with the composition could have kept that background entirely seamless and cleaned up the top right/left corners.  Maybe even getting a bit closer in to capture just the face/ arms would further simplify the shot.', '2006-12-06 12:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092731, 434630, 656, '<td valign="top">The really black background makes this feel like it is shot in a studio or somewhere else removed from a ''homely'' location.  Letting some more ambient light in the background might help to create more of a warm ''pool of light'' feel.</td>', 'The really black background makes this feel like it is shot in a studio or somewhere else removed from a ''homely'' location.  Letting some more ambient light in the background might help to create more of a warm ''pool of light'' feel.', '2006-12-06 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092734, 433921, 656, '<td valign="top">great group.  I''d be tempted to also try closer in and lower down if you were willing to get a bit wet - put their silhouettes up in the sky and catch more of the reflection</td>', 'great group.  I''d be tempted to also try closer in and lower down if you were willing to get a bit wet - put their silhouettes up in the sky and catch more of the reflection', '2006-12-06 12:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092736, 434491, 656, '<td valign="top">Some great expressions and interaction.  The light is soft and even too, though perhaps a shade underexposed.</td>', 'Some great expressions and interaction.  The light is soft and even too, though perhaps a shade underexposed.', '2006-12-06 12:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092737, 433969, 54208, '<td valign="top">most gorgeous clouds I''ve ever seen</td>', 'most gorgeous clouds I''ve ever seen', '2006-12-06 12:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092739, 435266, 656, '<td valign="top">good lighting, though maybe a touch harsh, which has left a lot of the shot in the mid grey range (background etc)  Seems to need a more overall high key feel and perhaps more diffuse light ?</td>', 'good lighting, though maybe a touch harsh, which has left a lot of the shot in the mid grey range (background etc)  Seems to need a more overall high key feel and perhaps more diffuse light ?', '2006-12-06 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092741, 435279, 656, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun time!  I think the black background doesn''t help though - something much brighter would be more appropriate, perhaps ?</td>', 'Looks like a fun time!  I think the black background doesn''t help though - something much brighter would be more appropriate, perhaps ?', '2006-12-06 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092743, 435229, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice, tight portrait.  Good light in the eyes.  I''m guessing this is from a fairly low resolution camera or a tight crop, because it is suffering from a lot of artifacts.</td>', 'Nice, tight portrait.  Good light in the eyes.  I''m guessing this is from a fairly low resolution camera or a tight crop, because it is suffering from a lot of artifacts.', '2006-12-06 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092758, 435255, 656, '<td valign="top">Overall feels a soft/ blurry, but somehow ends up looking a bit oversharpened with it (e.g., the left arm)<br/> <br/>A good idea and the lighting seems good.  Lacking any real highlight values, leaves it feeling grey though.</td>', 'Overall feels a soft/ blurry, but somehow ends up looking a bit oversharpened with it (e.g., the left arm) A good idea and the lighting seems good.  Lacking any real highlight values, leaves it feeling grey though.', '2006-12-06 12:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092760, 434973, 63703, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. The hedge and the tombstones are blurred. I suppose this is part camera shake, and part limited DOF. Using a tripod and stopping down might have resulted in a better picture.</td>', 'Love the idea. The hedge and the tombstones are blurred. I suppose this is part camera shake, and part limited DOF. Using a tripod and stopping down might have resulted in a better picture.', '2006-12-06 12:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092762, 435212, 656, '<td valign="top">Almost feels like something from a 60''s film still, because of the grain/ texture in the background and soft focus on the subject.</td>', 'Almost feels like something from a 60''s film still, because of the grain/ texture in the background and soft focus on the subject.', '2006-12-06 12:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092763, 435170, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very clever !</td>', 'Very clever !', '2006-12-06 12:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092766, 434682, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting light on her face - reflecting from the present ?  I think capturing a different expression/ eyes open might give more of a feeling of ''life''</td>', 'Interesting light on her face - reflecting from the present ?  I think capturing a different expression/ eyes open might give more of a feeling of ''life''', '2006-12-06 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092769, 434510, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very interesting</td>', 'Very interesting', '2006-12-06 12:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092771, 434380, 656, '<td valign="top">Strong concept, with the heart shape and the hands/ stomach.  The overall lighting seems very dark/ gloomy though which doesn''t enhance the feel of ''life''</td>', 'Strong concept, with the heart shape and the hands/ stomach.  The overall lighting seems very dark/ gloomy though which doesn''t enhance the feel of ''life''', '2006-12-06 12:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092775, 434291, 656, '<td valign="top">very candid capture.  Good tight framing.</td>', 'very candid capture.  Good tight framing.', '2006-12-06 12:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092779, 435235, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice and tight portrait, with something going on.  Background is quite busy/ close to the subject though - perhaps more separation would help, if you couldn''t go to a larger aperture.   Some light in her eyes (e.g., bounced from a reflector) would really liven them up.  The light seems very even and soft (cloudy day?) which is a good choice for portraits.</td>', 'Nice and tight portrait, with something going on.  Background is quite busy/ close to the subject though - perhaps more separation would help, if you couldn''t go to a larger aperture.   Some light in her eyes (e.g., bounced from a reflector) would really liven them up.  The light seems very even and soft (cloudy day?) which is a good choice for portraits.', '2006-12-06 12:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092781, 435281, 63703, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Is that a dragon egg ? :)</td>', 'Interesting. Is that a dragon egg ? :)', '2006-12-06 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092783, 435034, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2006-12-06 12:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
