(3092792, 434775, 62906, '<td valign="top">I really love the concept of the shot (and it happenes to be my favorite Scotch) but, unfortunately the glass can barely be seen and the scotch is nearly completely unvisible.  With a tweak to bring those 2 items into play, it would ba a really beautiful shot.</td>', 'I really love the concept of the shot (and it happenes to be my favorite Scotch) but, unfortunately the glass can barely be seen and the scotch is nearly completely unvisible.  With a tweak to bring those 2 items into play, it would ba a really beautiful shot.', '2006-12-06 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092796, 433049, 656, '<td valign="top">I really like what is happening with the leaf and the light in the lower left of the picture.  I''d be tempted to crop quite hard down to just the leaf, to get rid of the solid, vertical line of the trunk/ branch in the right hand side, which acts like a big barrier/ guide out of the picture</td>', 'I really like what is happening with the leaf and the light in the lower left of the picture.  I''d be tempted to crop quite hard down to just the leaf, to get rid of the solid, vertical line of the trunk/ branch in the right hand side, which acts like a big barrier/ guide out of the picture', '2006-12-06 12:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092801, 435311, 656, '<td valign="top">Creative use of lighting is working to raise this picture above what it might have been.  I think some more work on the light could really enhance this further though.</td>', 'Creative use of lighting is working to raise this picture above what it might have been.  I think some more work on the light could really enhance this further though.', '2006-12-06 12:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092802, 435244, 63703, '<td valign="top">Arresting. Powerful. Brilliant.</td>', 'Arresting. Powerful. Brilliant.', '2006-12-06 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
