(3092807, 434635, 656, '<td valign="top">Feels like a vertical orientation on the camera might have created a more dynamic sweep of the foreground plant/ coral and simplified the composition ?</td>', 'Feels like a vertical orientation on the camera might have created a more dynamic sweep of the foreground plant/ coral and simplified the composition ?', '2006-12-06 12:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092810, 435266, 63703, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2006-12-06 12:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092811, 435300, 656, '<td valign="top">Very tender shot, though the highkey/ over exposure is taking me away from the subject.  I''d be tempted to crop in about an inch from the top and right, to focus attention right on the face.  Not a big fan of the triple border either, seems overly fussy for what should be a simple, clean subject.</td>', 'Very tender shot, though the highkey/ over exposure is taking me away from the subject.  I''d be tempted to crop in about an inch from the top and right, to focus attention right on the face.  Not a big fan of the triple border either, seems overly fussy for what should be a simple, clean subject.', '2006-12-06 12:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092816, 435305, 656, '<td valign="top">creative use of painting with light.</td>', 'creative use of painting with light.', '2006-12-06 12:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092817, 433201, 49773, '<td valign="top">Hm, somehow I have a strong feeling that this is rotated ccw. Actually I''m sure it is. There''s just something peculiar about this, but nevertheless I like it. Peagon and the lonely man, both independent in their own ways.</td>', 'Hm, somehow I have a strong feeling that this is rotated ccw. Actually I''m sure it is. There''s just something peculiar about this, but nevertheless I like it. Peagon and the lonely man, both independent in their own ways.', '2006-12-06 12:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092819, 435226, 656, '<td valign="top">Tender moment, with good light.  I think I''d like to see a bit more of his face, maybe pulled to the left just enough to see his full profile.  Overall it feels a bit soft.</td>', 'Tender moment, with good light.  I think I''d like to see a bit more of his face, maybe pulled to the left just enough to see his full profile.  Overall it feels a bit soft.', '2006-12-06 12:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092822, 435281, 656, '<td valign="top">wow, great lighting effect, with the backlit shell.  I think I''d prefer to see a more complete shell with a real ''exit'' rather than this that looks like it has been stuck back together</td>', 'wow, great lighting effect, with the backlit shell.  I think I''d prefer to see a more complete shell with a real ''exit'' rather than this that looks like it has been stuck back together', '2006-12-06 12:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092827, 434510, 656, '<td valign="top">Good use of the ring as a framing device/ frame within the frame.  Really helps focus the eye on the subjects.  I''m not sure that the heavy grain/ texturing and colour treatment really add to a feeling of life, though it does feel old fashioned as a result.</td>', 'Good use of the ring as a framing device/ frame within the frame.  Really helps focus the eye on the subjects.  I''m not sure that the heavy grain/ texturing and colour treatment really add to a feeling of life, though it does feel old fashioned as a result.', '2006-12-06 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092828, 435317, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting digi-scoping.  I don''t really see any clear/ specific subject in the view though</td>', 'Interesting digi-scoping.  I don''t really see any clear/ specific subject in the view though', '2006-12-06 12:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092829, 435244, 25921, '<td valign="top">Hate to say it, but the subject matter is just too crude to receive a fair evaluation of it''s photographic merits.  This would be on par with me taking a picture of my poop and naming it ''Bacteria''s Playground''.  Your image is meaningful, but too offensive in my opinion to do well.  Good luck though.</td>', 'Hate to say it, but the subject matter is just too crude to receive a fair evaluation of it''s photographic merits.  This would be on par with me taking a picture of my poop and naming it ''Bacteria''s Playground''.  Your image is meaningful, but too offensive in my opinion to do well.  Good luck though.', '2006-12-06 13:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092833, 435097, 656, '<td valign="top">Good lighting (though I think a cleaner/ brighter background would be stronger.  The dirty orange/white feel doesn''t quite work.  Interesting choice of nesting materials!</td>', 'Good lighting (though I think a cleaner/ brighter background would be stronger.  The dirty orange/white feel doesn''t quite work.  Interesting choice of nesting materials!', '2006-12-06 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092835, 434511, 656, '<td valign="top">Pretty orange sunset.  I think something that gave a stronger silhouette (both literally and thematically) would really enhance this shot</td>', 'Pretty orange sunset.  I think something that gave a stronger silhouette (both literally and thematically) would really enhance this shot', '2006-12-06 13:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092839, 435314, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the use of painting with light to trace the path in the game.  Adds a level of interest that wouldn''t be there with a literal shot of the board.<br/> <br/>Might have been interesting to try to mix the painted with light lighting with some ambient/ fill flash so that it wasn''t completely dark.</td>', 'I like the use of painting with light to trace the path in the game.  Adds a level of interest that wouldn''t be there with a literal shot of the board. Might have been interesting to try to mix the painted with light lighting with some ambient/ fill flash so that it wasn''t completely dark.', '2006-12-06 13:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092842, 434775, 25921, '<td valign="top">Though it adds to the mood of the photo, i think this one could stand to be a little lighter.  At least enough to see the shape of the glass. I like it despite this though.</td>', 'Though it adds to the mood of the photo, i think this one could stand to be a little lighter.  At least enough to see the shape of the glass. I like it despite this though.', '2006-12-06 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092844, 434535, 656, '<td valign="top">Crisp capture and I like the off-center placement of the center.</td>', 'Crisp capture and I like the off-center placement of the center.', '2006-12-06 13:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092846, 435318, 656, '<td valign="top">Great colour, nice tight portrait, good lighting.  Her face does seem a bit soft though, as if the focus was on the front of the umbrella.  A bit more light in her eyes would really give her more life (e.g., using a small reflector)  Also the picture overall could be larger to submit to DPC.</td>', 'Great colour, nice tight portrait, good lighting.  Her face does seem a bit soft though, as if the focus was on the front of the umbrella.  A bit more light in her eyes would really give her more life (e.g., using a small reflector)  Also the picture overall could be larger to submit to DPC.', '2006-12-06 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092849, 435035, 656, '<td valign="top">Great choice of perspective and a good find(?) within the desolation.  The burned in edges/ vignette holds the eye in the scene too.</td>', 'Great choice of perspective and a good find(?) within the desolation.  The burned in edges/ vignette holds the eye in the scene too.', '2006-12-06 13:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092850, 434293, 25921, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen a bit greater DOF, but the bokeh is very nice.  Looks overly processed to me, but I couldn''t say how.  Has something to do with the sharpness and DOF.  Despite this, it''s a good composition and the little critter is awesome looking. 6.</td>', 'I would like to have seen a bit greater DOF, but the bokeh is very nice.  Looks overly processed to me, but I couldn''t say how.  Has something to do with the sharpness and DOF.  Despite this, it''s a good composition and the little critter is awesome looking. 6.', '2006-12-06 13:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092851, 435211, 656, '<td valign="top">Lots of life and greenery.  The leaves coming in from the left sort of break up the frame a bit more than I like.</td>', 'Lots of life and greenery.  The leaves coming in from the left sort of break up the frame a bit more than I like.', '2006-12-06 13:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092852, 434031, 656, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting you''ve used and the fact that there seems to be some ambient to show the rest of the nest.  Maybe having the egg cracked open and that light spilling out might be more effective too ?</td>', 'I like the lighting you''ve used and the fact that there seems to be some ambient to show the rest of the nest.  Maybe having the egg cracked open and that light spilling out might be more effective too ?', '2006-12-06 13:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092854, 435097, 25921, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the rubber bands.  I think this photo would be stronger without them. Good execution of the idea though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the rubber bands.  I think this photo would be stronger without them. Good execution of the idea though.', '2006-12-06 13:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092855, 435221, 656, '<td valign="top">I can see that you are trying to tie the church and palm reader together, but the trees/ power lines/ hydrant etc all get in the way of that concept.  I like the bottom two thirds of the shot, with the bright colours and strong shapes.</td>', 'I can see that you are trying to tie the church and palm reader together, but the trees/ power lines/ hydrant etc all get in the way of that concept.  I like the bottom two thirds of the shot, with the bright colours and strong shapes.', '2006-12-06 13:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092858, 433960, 656, '<td valign="top">Good mix of things going on, but none of them seem connected or associated with the photo.  In fact almost the complete opposite, with them all looking away from the camera, out of the frame or off into the distance.  My eye just leaves with them and doesn''t really find anything to bring me back or retain my interest.</td>', 'Good mix of things going on, but none of them seem connected or associated with the photo.  In fact almost the complete opposite, with them all looking away from the camera, out of the frame or off into the distance.  My eye just leaves with them and doesn''t really find anything to bring me back or retain my interest.', '2006-12-06 13:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092861, 434240, 656, '<td valign="top">strong foreground, consistent background textures and good subject placement.</td>', 'strong foreground, consistent background textures and good subject placement.', '2006-12-06 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092862, 433684, 25921, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasing photograph.  I would like to have seen a little bit more below the shoulders.  To me,  this photo places too much emphasis on the lollipop.  I think adding the contextual background that a more vertical crop would have given would have improved this one.  Just some opinions.  Overall though, I like it.  This could easily have that ''family snapshot'' feel to it, but you have successfully avoided this.</td>', 'This is a pleasing photograph.  I would like to have seen a little bit more below the shoulders.  To me,  this photo places too much emphasis on the lollipop.  I think adding the contextual background that a more vertical crop would have given would have improved this one.  Just some opinions.  Overall though, I like it.  This could easily have that ''family snapshot'' feel to it, but you have successfully avoided this.', '2006-12-06 13:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092863, 434274, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like the basic composition, with the road sweeping off in that super curve  The pose of the child id good, but I do wish all of his shadow was in the frame.</td>', 'I like the basic composition, with the road sweeping off in that super curve  The pose of the child id good, but I do wish all of his shadow was in the frame.', '2006-12-06 13:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092864, 434658, 656, '<td valign="top">clean concept and good background.  I''m not sure I really like the hand posing though.</td>', 'clean concept and good background.  I''m not sure I really like the hand posing though.', '2006-12-06 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092865, 434210, 656, '<td valign="top">The green really gives a good ''life'' feel.  Good colour choice.</td>', 'The green really gives a good ''life'' feel.  Good colour choice.', '2006-12-06 13:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092867, 435160, 25921, '<td valign="top">The colors seem artificial on my monitor for some reason, like it''s somehow hyperrealistic.  I like the image and the message though. 6</td>', 'The colors seem artificial on my monitor for some reason, like it''s somehow hyperrealistic.  I like the image and the message though. 6', '2006-12-06 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092869, 435073, 656, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing on this.  Good tight concept shot too.  I don''t really get ''life'' other than the title though.</td>', 'I really like the processing on this.  Good tight concept shot too.  I don''t really get ''life'' other than the title though.', '2006-12-06 13:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092870, 434421, 656, '<td valign="top">Austin, from Joe''s crab shack ?   I find night shots can sometimes be stronger at twilight on a clear night before the sky goes really black (or orange like in this case)  The deep blue can really enhance the feel of the shot. <br/> <br/>Looks like a boat went past your foreground too, giving the slightly odd water reflections.</td>', 'Austin, from Joe''s crab shack ?   I find night shots can sometimes be stronger at twilight on a clear night before the sky goes really black (or orange like in this case)  The deep blue can really enhance the feel of the shot.  Looks like a boat went past your foreground too, giving the slightly odd water reflections.', '2006-12-06 13:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092872, 434670, 656, '<td valign="top">Really great light and expression.  I keep wanting to crop the ear/ left side off, to about half way between the ear/ left eye. I feel it simplifies and strengthens the shot - my attention stays bang on his face then.</td>', 'Really great light and expression.  I keep wanting to crop the ear/ left side off, to about half way between the ear/ left eye. I feel it simplifies and strengthens the shot - my attention stays bang on his face then.', '2006-12-06 13:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092873, 434658, 5112, '<td valign="top">That''s not how it''s done!  :)))))</td>', 'That''s not how it''s done!  :)))))', '2006-12-06 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092874, 434973, 67258, '<td valign="top">A good idea, the transposition of life and death.  I feel that you could have made more of the framing - it is a shame, for example, that the tall black pinnacle obscures the baby motif.  The focus on the gravestones is also off, which means that we can''t read the insriptions, and I do feel for this to work it needs the focus to be crisp from front to back.</td>', 'A good idea, the transposition of life and death.  I feel that you could have made more of the framing - it is a shame, for example, that the tall black pinnacle obscures the baby motif.  The focus on the gravestones is also off, which means that we can''t read the insriptions, and I do feel for this to work it needs the focus to be crisp from front to back.', '2006-12-06 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092876, 435036, 656, '<td valign="top">Great colour choice, strong blue/ yellow contrast and complimentary colours.  I''d like to chop off about half an inch at the top, just to tighten the composition a bit (removing the edges of the bowl) but that would need the top flower to be brought down a bit/ removed too</td>', 'Great colour choice, strong blue/ yellow contrast and complimentary colours.  I''d like to chop off about half an inch at the top, just to tighten the composition a bit (removing the edges of the bowl) but that would need the top flower to be brought down a bit/ removed too', '2006-12-06 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092877, 434255, 656, '<td valign="top">Great frame in a frame, lovely light and colours.  Solid shot though I don''t really feel ''life'' in this.</td>', 'Great frame in a frame, lovely light and colours.  Solid shot though I don''t really feel ''life'' in this.', '2006-12-06 13:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092878, 433921, 67258, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem very sharp.  It would also be nice to see a little more animation in the childrens'' poses - perhaps with arms up in the air, or catching one of them mid jump.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem very sharp.  It would also be nice to see a little more animation in the childrens'' poses - perhaps with arms up in the air, or catching one of them mid jump.', '2006-12-06 13:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092880, 433018, 656, '<td valign="top">lovely use of lighting.  Strong symbolic message.  Doesn''t work for me personally but I suspect it will do well.</td>', 'lovely use of lighting.  Strong symbolic message.  Doesn''t work for me personally but I suspect it will do well.', '2006-12-06 13:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092886, 434834, 656, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see some of the people in these shots ''now'' along with the pictures, or their descendants.  That would maybe make the connection to the past even stronger than is apparent here.</td>', 'I''d love to see some of the people in these shots ''now'' along with the pictures, or their descendants.  That would maybe make the connection to the past even stronger than is apparent here.', '2006-12-06 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092888, 435027, 67258, '<td valign="top">A sweet photo, and a nice one for the family album, but at the end it is just a good family snapshot.</td>', 'A sweet photo, and a nice one for the family album, but at the end it is just a good family snapshot.', '2006-12-06 13:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092892, 434161, 656, '<td valign="top">effective slow flash sync and camera movement - added a lot of life to this shot.  Great expression and dynamic angle too.  Good example of this kind of shooting.</td>', 'effective slow flash sync and camera movement - added a lot of life to this shot.  Great expression and dynamic angle too.  Good example of this kind of shooting.', '2006-12-06 13:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092895, 433969, 656, '<td valign="top">Great sky/ clouds and light.  The silhouette works really well and I love the really dramatic ground crop.  The sky seems to have gone very strange though, due to your processing ?</td>', 'Great sky/ clouds and light.  The silhouette works really well and I love the really dramatic ground crop.  The sky seems to have gone very strange though, due to your processing ?', '2006-12-06 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092901, 435256, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely light for this sort of portrait.  I also really like the out of focus background that implies trees/ rolling landscape behind.  I think the expression could be better though.</td>', 'Lovely light for this sort of portrait.  I also really like the out of focus background that implies trees/ rolling landscape behind.  I think the expression could be better though.', '2006-12-06 13:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092903, 434227, 67258, '<td valign="top">Composition is cluttered; I would prefer a sharper focus on the rings.</td>', 'Composition is cluttered; I would prefer a sharper focus on the rings.', '2006-12-06 13:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092905, 434274, 656, '<td valign="top">strong leading line with the road going off to the distance.  I like the composition</td>', 'strong leading line with the road going off to the distance.  I like the composition', '2006-12-06 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092906, 434724, 656, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  Interesting subject.</td>', 'Good lighting.  Interesting subject.', '2006-12-06 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3092911, 435170, 656, '<td valign="top">I could see this winning.  Nice setup shot and concept.  I''d love to see some light spilling out of the egg, or similar.  Either that or a light source off camera in the top right</td>', 'I could see this winning.  Nice setup shot and concept.  I''d love to see some light spilling out of the egg, or similar.  Either that or a light source off camera in the top right', '2006-12-06 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092913, 434524, 656, '<td valign="top">love the green/ blue colours</td>', 'love the green/ blue colours', '2006-12-06 13:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092914, 434529, 656, '<td valign="top">nice attempt at a classic symbol</td>', 'nice attempt at a classic symbol', '2006-12-06 13:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092915, 433823, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t recognise the language, and can''t translate, but would assume the legible text refers to the concept of life.  nfortunately, I don''t feel this realy works - the margins of the book are very wide, ad the eye isn''t drawn comfortably to the text that has been highlighted.</td>', 'I don''t recognise the language, and can''t translate, but would assume the legible text refers to the concept of life.  nfortunately, I don''t feel this realy works - the margins of the book are very wide, ad the eye isn''t drawn comfortably to the text that has been highlighted.', '2006-12-06 13:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092916, 433690, 656, '<td valign="top">love the dramatic crop and plenty of sky.  Cool colours too.  I wish the silhouettes were doing something more ''dynamic''</td>', 'love the dramatic crop and plenty of sky.  Cool colours too.  I wish the silhouettes were doing something more ''dynamic''', '2006-12-06 13:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092917, 435170, 67258, '<td valign="top">Seriously cute idea - simple, effective, and amusing.</td>', 'Seriously cute idea - simple, effective, and amusing.', '2006-12-06 13:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092918, 435258, 656, '<td valign="top">good symbolic relationship between the burnt wood and new life growing out of it.</td>', 'good symbolic relationship between the burnt wood and new life growing out of it.', '2006-12-06 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092921, 434962, 656, '<td valign="top">I can see a lot of potential in this opportunity.  I''d love to see a much tighter shot of him really playing in the straw, throwing it up in the air, right in the middle of everything, with just the straw behind him as a background.</td>', 'I can see a lot of potential in this opportunity.  I''d love to see a much tighter shot of him really playing in the straw, throwing it up in the air, right in the middle of everything, with just the straw behind him as a background.', '2006-12-06 13:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092922, 435154, 63703, '<td valign="top">Very clever</td>', 'Very clever', '2006-12-06 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092923, 434024, 656, '<td valign="top">Very clean, well lit product shot.  Focus and depth of field is good but there isn''t much ''dramatic'' about this to score it highly.  Competently done.</td>', 'Very clean, well lit product shot.  Focus and depth of field is good but there isn''t much ''dramatic'' about this to score it highly.  Competently done.', '2006-12-06 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092926, 434194, 656, '<td valign="top">This seems like a great starting point for a strong entry.  But the location you''ve found this in doesn''t really help it much and the light is very harsh.  Compositionally you could perhaps get in closer and maybe have the subject not quite so bang in the center of the frame.  Focus seems a bit soft too.</td>', 'This seems like a great starting point for a strong entry.  But the location you''ve found this in doesn''t really help it much and the light is very harsh.  Compositionally you could perhaps get in closer and maybe have the subject not quite so bang in the center of the frame.  Focus seems a bit soft too.', '2006-12-06 13:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092927, 435229, 67258, '<td valign="top">There is something that just isn''t right here, and I assume it is in the post-processing.  The eyes lack clarity and sharpness, and the skin seems to lack texture.</td>', 'There is something that just isn''t right here, and I assume it is in the post-processing.  The eyes lack clarity and sharpness, and the skin seems to lack texture.', '2006-12-06 13:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092928, 434129, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very absract and cool. I love hox crisp it is.</td>', 'Very absract and cool. I love hox crisp it is.', '2006-12-06 13:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092929, 434430, 656, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  I suspect this will do well.  The green side lighting could maybe have been a bit brighter to raise the overall feel from being quite so dark.</td>', 'Great lighting.  I suspect this will do well.  The green side lighting could maybe have been a bit brighter to raise the overall feel from being quite so dark.', '2006-12-06 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092931, 433018, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful silhouette - beautiful message.  Would make a good cover for a Easter Sunrise service bulletin cover.</td>', 'Beautiful silhouette - beautiful message.  Would make a good cover for a Easter Sunrise service bulletin cover.', '2006-12-06 13:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092932, 434488, 656, '<td valign="top">overall focus seems quite soft.  Good tight framing and fairly clean background works well though.</td>', 'overall focus seems quite soft.  Good tight framing and fairly clean background works well though.', '2006-12-06 13:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092936, 435162, 656, '<td valign="top">wow, funky colours.</td>', 'wow, funky colours.', '2006-12-06 13:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092938, 434210, 63703, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2006-12-06 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092939, 434685, 67258, '<td valign="top">The basic composition is interesting, and has a lot of potential.  I would like to have seen a little more of the raised child'' face, and some indication of eye contact between the girls.</td>', 'The basic composition is interesting, and has a lot of potential.  I would like to have seen a little more of the raised child'' face, and some indication of eye contact between the girls.', '2006-12-06 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092940, 434263, 656, '<td valign="top">Lovely light, great angle and well filled frame.  I wish I could see a touch more of the pup''s face though, rather than it being hidden by the whiskers</td>', 'Lovely light, great angle and well filled frame.  I wish I could see a touch more of the pup''s face though, rather than it being hidden by the whiskers', '2006-12-06 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092941, 434603, 656, '<td valign="top">Yes, very cute.  But also well framed.  Light seems maybe a touch harsh and could do with a bit of shadow fill, but a great example of a pet portrait.</td>', 'Yes, very cute.  But also well framed.  Light seems maybe a touch harsh and could do with a bit of shadow fill, but a great example of a pet portrait.', '2006-12-06 13:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092943, 433758, 656, '<td valign="top">Sort of thing that would be good as part of a series of similar shots at different times or with different moods.</td>', 'Sort of thing that would be good as part of a series of similar shots at different times or with different moods.', '2006-12-06 13:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092946, 435212, 67258, '<td valign="top">Focus seems rather soft, but a good idea and combined with the clever title meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Focus seems rather soft, but a good idea and combined with the clever title meets the challenge well.', '2006-12-06 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092947, 434835, 63703, '<td valign="top">Ah ! Nicely done.</td>', 'Ah ! Nicely done.', '2006-12-06 13:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092948, 435183, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow - is that tree real ?  I''d be tempted to shoot with a slightly longer lens or zoom in and try to capture more of the tree and its reflection, without so much sky or the foreground birds.</td>', 'Wow - is that tree real ?  I''d be tempted to shoot with a slightly longer lens or zoom in and try to capture more of the tree and its reflection, without so much sky or the foreground birds.', '2006-12-06 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092949, 435316, 656, '<td valign="top">Another fine example of this idea.  Will no doubt score well.</td>', 'Another fine example of this idea.  Will no doubt score well.', '2006-12-06 13:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092950, 434239, 67258, '<td valign="top">Full of life, fun and vitality.</td>', 'Full of life, fun and vitality.', '2006-12-06 13:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092952, 434380, 67258, '<td valign="top">A useful prop, this one!</td>', 'A useful prop, this one!', '2006-12-06 13:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092953, 434274, 63703, '<td valign="top">Harsh title, harsh light, and harsh composition. I like it. Very bold.</td>', 'Harsh title, harsh light, and harsh composition. I like it. Very bold.', '2006-12-06 13:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092954, 434263, 47316, '<td valign="top">How adorable! Great capture.</td>', 'How adorable! Great capture.', '2006-12-06 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092956, 435314, 63703, '<td valign="top">Clever :)</td>', 'Clever :)', '2006-12-06 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092957, 434775, 656, '<td valign="top">A uisce beatha, the water of life.  Nothing says ''life'' to me more than a good whisky and Glenlivet is my favourite (though the 18 year old)<br/> <br/>Has to be high marks!  I think I''d like this better with more back light coming through the sample poured in the glass though, to show the warmth of the contents.</td>', 'A uisce beatha, the water of life.  Nothing says ''life'' to me more than a good whisky and Glenlivet is my favourite (though the 18 year old) Has to be high marks!  I think I''d like this better with more back light coming through the sample poured in the glass though, to show the warmth of the contents.', '2006-12-06 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092961, 434680, 656, '<td valign="top">Feels like ''saw'' meets ''chicken little''<br/> <br/>Quentin Tarantino does Sesame Street.  Reservoir Big Bird</td>', 'Feels like ''saw'' meets ''chicken little'' Quentin Tarantino does Sesame Street.  Reservoir Big Bird', '2006-12-06 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092963, 435282, 656, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting.  I feel it would suit a white background more though.</td>', 'Cool lighting.  I feel it would suit a white background more though.', '2006-12-06 13:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092966, 434524, 47316, '<td valign="top">Great colors!</td>', 'Great colors!', '2006-12-06 13:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092967, 435036, 67258, '<td valign="top">Could do with being a bit sharper.</td>', 'Could do with being a bit sharper.', '2006-12-06 13:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092968, 435008, 656, '<td valign="top">classic greek sort of pose.  Would prefer her nose ''behind'' his mouth and I think the lighting from the left is casting a bit too much shadow on his chest.  Would also be tempted to crop her shoulder out of the frame.</td>', 'classic greek sort of pose.  Would prefer her nose ''behind'' his mouth and I think the lighting from the left is casting a bit too much shadow on his chest.  Would also be tempted to crop her shoulder out of the frame.', '2006-12-06 13:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092970, 434508, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a magical looking place!</td>', 'What a magical looking place!', '2006-12-06 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092971, 434656, 656, '<td valign="top">great sense of depth and the crowd.  Excellent use of DoF to isolate the subject, though would prefer maybe without the person directly to his front/ left.</td>', 'great sense of depth and the crowd.  Excellent use of DoF to isolate the subject, though would prefer maybe without the person directly to his front/ left.', '2006-12-06 13:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092973, 434221, 63703, '<td valign="top">spectacular picture</td>', 'spectacular picture', '2006-12-06 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092975, 433909, 656, '<td valign="top">A really special time to capture - but the background has so much clutter and stuff in it.  Filing cabinets, lighters, heaters etc really don''t enhance or add to the shot at all.</td>', 'A really special time to capture - but the background has so much clutter and stuff in it.  Filing cabinets, lighters, heaters etc really don''t enhance or add to the shot at all.', '2006-12-06 13:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092976, 435154, 656, '<td valign="top">nice setup and light.</td>', 'nice setup and light.', '2006-12-06 13:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092977, 434165, 63703, '<td valign="top">Hmm - very disturbing.</td>', 'Hmm - very disturbing.', '2006-12-06 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092979, 435314, 40430, '<td valign="top">I like concept in this image. good exposure but angle of shot might be stronger if it were taken more vertically down towards the board instead of the angle such as it is.</td>', 'I like concept in this image. good exposure but angle of shot might be stronger if it were taken more vertically down towards the board instead of the angle such as it is.', '2006-12-06 13:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092980, 434129, 63703, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I wonder how this was done.</td>', 'Beautiful. I wonder how this was done.', '2006-12-06 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092981, 433904, 656, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the lighting is really harsh and all coming from the direction of the camera, which doesn''t enhance the scene much.  More diffusion would help, as would getting the light off camera if possible.</td>', 'Good idea but the lighting is really harsh and all coming from the direction of the camera, which doesn''t enhance the scene much.  More diffusion would help, as would getting the light off camera if possible.', '2006-12-06 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092982, 435035, 40430, '<td valign="top">most everything is a bit fuzzy for me here.</td>', 'most everything is a bit fuzzy for me here.', '2006-12-06 13:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092984, 434067, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow.  crazy colours, particularly in the blue snow ?</td>', 'Wow.  crazy colours, particularly in the blue snow ?', '2006-12-06 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092985, 435283, 40430, '<td valign="top">very crisp, good lighting</td>', 'very crisp, good lighting', '2006-12-06 13:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092988, 434949, 656, '<td valign="top">Cropping this vertically would help to remove the background clutter (chairs, book case, coats, lamps etc and would tend to favour the vertical subjects (people/ xmas tree)</td>', 'Cropping this vertically would help to remove the background clutter (chairs, book case, coats, lamps etc and would tend to favour the vertical subjects (people/ xmas tree)', '2006-12-06 13:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092992, 433201, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Love this.  I don''t really get a feel of ''life'' from it, but this is a beautiful shot.  I could even see it being strong vertically with some more of the columns, or from a slightly higher vantage point to really get more of the reflection that is appearing in the slick (wet) pavement</td>', 'Wow.  Love this.  I don''t really get a feel of ''life'' from it, but this is a beautiful shot.  I could even see it being strong vertically with some more of the columns, or from a slightly higher vantage point to really get more of the reflection that is appearing in the slick (wet) pavement', '2006-12-06 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092995, 434255, 40430, '<td valign="top">great colors and framing.-8-</td>', 'great colors and framing.-8-', '2006-12-06 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092997, 434291, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh to be young!  The woman standing behind the boy makes him look as though he has a blond pony tail!</td>', 'Oh to be young!  The woman standing behind the boy makes him look as though he has a blond pony tail!', '2006-12-06 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092998, 434933, 656, '<td valign="top">Very documentary/ photojournalistic feel to it.  The foggy weather is giving you really even light for portraiture and a great falloff in the detail.  The framing is strong too, with the fence and road.</td>', 'Very documentary/ photojournalistic feel to it.  The foggy weather is giving you really even light for portraiture and a great falloff in the detail.  The framing is strong too, with the fence and road.', '2006-12-06 13:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3092999, 433018, 40430, '<td valign="top">simple and to the point. great color contrast and sharp.-10-</td>', 'simple and to the point. great color contrast and sharp.-10-', '2006-12-06 13:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093001, 434785, 40430, '<td valign="top">too bright  and washed out. horizon seems off kilter but that might just be the trees.</td>', 'too bright  and washed out. horizon seems off kilter but that might just be the trees.', '2006-12-06 13:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093004, 434742, 40430, '<td valign="top">if the ears weren''t touching the sides of the image this would be an even stronger animal portrait than it is. great tones. -7-</td>', 'if the ears weren''t touching the sides of the image this would be an even stronger animal portrait than it is. great tones. -7-', '2006-12-06 13:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093007, 435049, 656, '<td valign="top">Cool colour combo of the green and magenta.  Very faerie &amp; ethereal</td>', 'Cool colour combo of the green and magenta.  Very faerie & ethereal', '2006-12-06 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093011, 434973, 40430, '<td valign="top">everything seems a bit fuzzy but like the contrast in subject matter within the image.</td>', 'everything seems a bit fuzzy but like the contrast in subject matter within the image.', '2006-12-06 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093013, 434262, 40430, '<td valign="top">very moody shot, good work</td>', 'very moody shot, good work', '2006-12-06 13:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093019, 435034, 656, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the black background enhances the concept of the shot.  Something brighter and more alive might work well (complimentary to the green?)</td>', 'I don''t think the black background enhances the concept of the shot.  Something brighter and more alive might work well (complimentary to the green?)', '2006-12-06 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093020, 434630, 40430, '<td valign="top">really good exposure</td>', 'really good exposure', '2006-12-06 13:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093027, 434129, 40430, '<td valign="top">this abstract really punches your eye, -9-</td>', 'this abstract really punches your eye, -9-', '2006-12-06 13:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093028, 434129, 656, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a lot of Ursula''s work.  Very cool abstract flow of the egg/ white in the background.  Cool light too.  I think the black line at the top really helps to frame and balance the shot.  Leading off to white wouldn''t be as strong.</td>', 'Reminds me of a lot of Ursula''s work.  Very cool abstract flow of the egg/ white in the background.  Cool light too.  I think the black line at the top really helps to frame and balance the shot.  Leading off to white wouldn''t be as strong.', '2006-12-06 13:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093048, 434194, 40430, '<td valign="top">seems out of focus</td>', 'seems out of focus', '2006-12-06 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093087, 433909, 5112, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit strange to see a baptism with a filing cabinet, a Kleenex box, a cigarette lighter in the background.  I think this is a beautiful image, and you caught the moment right (whether real or staged, and even though the water is actually missing the bowl).  I think it''s neat that the baby looks like a lot of babies do at baptisms, sort of like, "What are you doing to me?!?!"  It took me a moment to figure out that the string by the pastor''s glasses were because they''re reading glasses :)  Definitely celebrates life.  ~7</td>', 'It''s a bit strange to see a baptism with a filing cabinet, a Kleenex box, a cigarette lighter in the background.  I think this is a beautiful image, and you caught the moment right (whether real or staged, and even though the water is actually missing the bowl).  I think it''s neat that the baby looks like a lot of babies do at baptisms, sort of like, "What are you doing to me?!?!"  It took me a moment to figure out that the string by the pastor''s glasses were because they''re reading glasses :)  Definitely celebrates life.  ~7', '2006-12-06 14:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093089, 434742, 65319, '<td valign="top">The detail of this photo is astounding and the depth of field is excellent.  A wish for a perfect shot would be that both years are perked forward.  That split second timing for ear movement is difficult, but this photo a tremendous capture.  9.</td>', 'The detail of this photo is astounding and the depth of field is excellent.  A wish for a perfect shot would be that both years are perked forward.  That split second timing for ear movement is difficult, but this photo a tremendous capture.  9.', '2006-12-06 14:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3093090, 434973, 5112, '<td valign="top">Well now, quite a place to put a baby shop.  The interval here seems so short.  Good catch.</td>', 'Well now, quite a place to put a baby shop.  The interval here seems so short.  Good catch.', '2006-12-06 14:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
