(3094615, 434511, 69008, '<td valign="top">My nephew, a pro photographer alerted me to this so I will pass it on to you. It has helped many of my sunrise and sunset pics to raise the view to include more sky, and to eliminate a lot of the dark foreground, leaving only the part of the foreground with form and intrerest in the pic.</td>', 'My nephew, a pro photographer alerted me to this so I will pass it on to you. It has helped many of my sunrise and sunset pics to raise the view to include more sky, and to eliminate a lot of the dark foreground, leaving only the part of the foreground with form and intrerest in the pic.', '2006-12-06 22:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
