(3097321, 434074, 41370, '<td valign="top">If you had cropped the bottom a bit more so that the pond was at the bottom I think this would have been a better photo.</td>', 'If you had cropped the bottom a bit more so that the pond was at the bottom I think this would have been a better photo.', '2006-12-07 16:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097326, 434772, 41370, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the darkness of this photo and the crop.</td>', 'I really enjoy the darkness of this photo and the crop.', '2006-12-07 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097332, 434603, 41370, '<td valign="top">Cute cat! The light on the left side is a bit too harsh. I think it would have been better if you cropped just at the end of kitty''s whiskers.</td>', 'Cute cat! The light on the left side is a bit too harsh. I think it would have been better if you cropped just at the end of kitty''s whiskers.', '2006-12-07 16:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097336, 434658, 41370, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I would have liked a bit more contrast.</td>', 'I like the idea.  I would have liked a bit more contrast.', '2006-12-07 16:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097340, 435036, 41370, '<td valign="top">I like the colors.  I think the focus could have been a bit sharper</td>', 'I like the colors.  I think the focus could have been a bit sharper', '2006-12-07 16:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097361, 435317, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice color. Would work wekk as an abstract with a softer focus.</td>', 'Nice color. Would work wekk as an abstract with a softer focus.', '2006-12-07 16:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097366, 433968, 41370, '<td valign="top">IMHO this would have been better with a little contrast tweaking.</td>', 'IMHO this would have been better with a little contrast tweaking.', '2006-12-07 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097370, 434430, 41370, '<td valign="top">I generally don''t care for "woody" photos but I do like the color and concept in this photo.</td>', 'I generally don''t care for "woody" photos but I do like the color and concept in this photo.', '2006-12-07 16:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097371, 433690, 53316, '<td valign="top">I tried to look up the original but the search engine wasn''t giving me any results.  I think this is a good photo! I just wish I could appreciate it in the context of the original. If you''d like to PM me a link to a website with the original or something, that''d be cool.  (edit: Duh, didn''t think to search DPC! LOL. Great tribute.)</td>', 'I tried to look up the original but the search engine wasn''t giving me any results.  I think this is a good photo! I just wish I could appreciate it in the context of the original. If you''d like to PM me a link to a website with the original or something, that''d be cool.  (edit: Duh, didn''t think to search DPC! LOL. Great tribute.)', '2006-12-07 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097372, 434221, 41370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2006-12-07 16:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097381, 434785, 41370, '<td valign="top">Taken a photo of the sun is not an easy task.  This is too harsh in some areas and washed out in other.</td>', 'Taken a photo of the sun is not an easy task.  This is too harsh in some areas and washed out in other.', '2006-12-07 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097390, 435122, 41370, '<td valign="top">Cute kitty but focus could have been sharper</td>', 'Cute kitty but focus could have been sharper', '2006-12-07 16:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097399, 435033, 41370, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! Oh and on the baby too!</td>', 'Congratulations! Oh and on the baby too!', '2006-12-07 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097407, 433797, 41370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby.  The top corner and the cloth behind the baby really detract from the photo.  The foucs could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful baby.  The top corner and the cloth behind the baby really detract from the photo.  The foucs could have been a bit sharper.', '2006-12-07 16:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097412, 434949, 41370, '<td valign="top">To make this a better photo I recommend placing the tree to the side.  This way it appears the tree is coming out of the gentleman''s back.  Also a closer crop to get rid of the chair, lamps, coats and books would have been better.</td>', 'To make this a better photo I recommend placing the tree to the side.  This way it appears the tree is coming out of the gentleman''s back.  Also a closer crop to get rid of the chair, lamps, coats and books would have been better.', '2006-12-07 16:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097511, 433690, 66620, '<td valign="top">It''s such a simple picture, yet it grabs me.</td>', 'It''s such a simple picture, yet it grabs me.', '2006-12-07 17:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097517, 434884, 66620, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice photo but it doesn''t have a strong enough connection to the subjet in my opinion.</td>', 'It''s a nice photo but it doesn''t have a strong enough connection to the subjet in my opinion.', '2006-12-07 17:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097646, 434218, 53147, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. The pattern in back is nice rather than just plain white. Clean and well composed and a good take ont he challenge. Bumpingup.</td>', 'Interesting image. The pattern in back is nice rather than just plain white. Clean and well composed and a good take ont he challenge. Bumpingup.', '2006-12-07 18:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097651, 434635, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Pretty clean considering its underwater. Nice colors and a good capture of two "life" partners.</td>', 'Good capture. Pretty clean considering its underwater. Nice colors and a good capture of two "life" partners.', '2006-12-07 18:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097656, 434742, 53147, '<td valign="top">Thats pretty close up - almost feels too close or cropped too tightly IMO. Good detail and a pleasant image overall. Maybe lacking some good wow power.</td>', 'Thats pretty close up - almost feels too close or cropped too tightly IMO. Good detail and a pleasant image overall. Maybe lacking some good wow power.', '2006-12-07 18:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097660, 434256, 53147, '<td valign="top">Brand spanking new! Good capture of the cute lil critter.</td>', 'Brand spanking new! Good capture of the cute lil critter.', '2006-12-07 18:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097663, 434962, 53147, '<td valign="top">Fun image overall. Maybe stronger for his family members than most of the voters (but then I am guilty of those types of images over and over and over and...)</td>', 'Fun image overall. Maybe stronger for his family members than most of the voters (but then I am guilty of those types of images over and over and over and...)', '2006-12-07 18:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097666, 435285, 53147, '<td valign="top">Hope this wasnt you. Looks pretty scary. Seems a bit soft on the focus but a strong image none the less.</td>', 'Hope this wasnt you. Looks pretty scary. Seems a bit soft on the focus but a strong image none the less.', '2006-12-07 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097668, 434491, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice family capture. And that sure is the motto of life. Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice family capture. And that sure is the motto of life. Nice shot.', '2006-12-07 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097689, 434510, 45475, '<td valign="top">This is not an image I can easily cruise by on. As I slowly absorb, it finally hits me what you mean by "generations", or rather, what I''m seeing as generations.  The ring sculpture symbolizing eternal and the poignant symbolism of the children framed within. All against a backdrop of old architecture and the formidable new. Much much more to see here... wonderful vision.</td>', 'This is not an image I can easily cruise by on. As I slowly absorb, it finally hits me what you mean by "generations", or rather, what I''m seeing as generations.  The ring sculpture symbolizing eternal and the poignant symbolism of the children framed within. All against a backdrop of old architecture and the formidable new. Much much more to see here... wonderful vision.', '2006-12-07 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097695, 435097, 45475, '<td valign="top">hehehe... omg how big is the chicken!! :) <i>Still makes me smile big... bumping up to 10</i></td>', 'hehehe... omg how big is the chicken!! :) Still makes me smile big... bumping up to 10', '2006-12-07 18:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3097696, 433322, 45475, '<td valign="top">Awesome [cough] scenery ;) Seriously though, it''s a spectacular capture. I think you''ve handled the exposure very well and it''s a solid composition. Good work.</td>', 'Awesome [cough] scenery ;) Seriously though, it''s a spectacular capture. I think you''ve handled the exposure very well and it''s a solid composition. Good work.', '2006-12-07 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
