(3097705, 435244, 45475, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this is a super shot. If it is what I think it is, could be a little too confronting for some. Still, it certainly gives one pause for serious thought and not just a fleeting glance.</td>', 'Gosh, this is a super shot. If it is what I think it is, could be a little too confronting for some. Still, it certainly gives one pause for serious thought and not just a fleeting glance.', '2006-12-07 18:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
