(3098233, 435184, 61818, '<td valign="top">Two interesting things here.  The guy and his chalk drawing.  Unfortunately neither one is really presented well.  I''m thinking instead of the back of his coat, a shot of his face as he was laying that down on the sidewalk would have offered more for the mind to digest.  I wonder were you afraid to get in front of him and blast off twenty shots?  Maybe this was your planned shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'Two interesting things here.  The guy and his chalk drawing.  Unfortunately neither one is really presented well.  I''m thinking instead of the back of his coat, a shot of his face as he was laying that down on the sidewalk would have offered more for the mind to digest.  I wonder were you afraid to get in front of him and blast off twenty shots?  Maybe this was your planned shot.  Good luck.', '2006-12-07 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
