(3099186, 435318, 41370, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors and smile</td>', 'beautiful colors and smile', '2006-12-08 06:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099187, 433201, 48228, '<td valign="top">A solitary man walking alone, is a really thought provoking idea. What is he thinking and where is he going. Only he knows, and thats life, to this man in the dark coat. This image has questions, and hard to find the answers, but for some reason, I like it.....</td>', 'A solitary man walking alone, is a really thought provoking idea. What is he thinking and where is he going. Only he knows, and thats life, to this man in the dark coat. This image has questions, and hard to find the answers, but for some reason, I like it.....', '2006-12-08 06:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099189, 435314, 41370, '<td valign="top">Good concept for th challenge and nicely executed</td>', 'Good concept for th challenge and nicely executed', '2006-12-08 06:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099190, 435282, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice color and contrast</td>', 'Nice color and contrast', '2006-12-08 06:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099193, 435235, 41370, '<td valign="top">A more shallow depth of field (bluring the background) would have helped this photo and possibly a little more saturation in the color.</td>', 'A more shallow depth of field (bluring the background) would have helped this photo and possibly a little more saturation in the color.', '2006-12-08 06:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099195, 435229, 41370, '<td valign="top">Cropping out the background or a more shallow depth of field would help this photo.  The eyes could have been in sharper focus.</td>', 'Cropping out the background or a more shallow depth of field would help this photo.  The eyes could have been in sharper focus.', '2006-12-08 06:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099196, 434510, 48228, '<td valign="top">The circle of life, by the huge "O", one can find one self looking through the circle of life to a new life, or an old life. It just doesn''t matter as the circle of life is where it begins, continues and ends.....</td>', 'The circle of life, by the huge "O", one can find one self looking through the circle of life to a new life, or an old life. It just doesn''t matter as the circle of life is where it begins, continues and ends.....', '2006-12-08 06:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099198, 434024, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel color and depth of field.</td>', 'Nice pastel color and depth of field.', '2006-12-08 06:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099199, 434165, 69351, '<td valign="top">htf</td>', 'htf', '2006-12-08 06:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099200, 433765, 41370, '<td valign="top">Most probably won''t like the light spot by the cheek, but I do.  Cute kitty.</td>', 'Most probably won''t like the light spot by the cheek, but I do.  Cute kitty.', '2006-12-08 06:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099204, 434638, 41370, '<td valign="top">A little more cropped off the right side of the photo, stronger saturation and a sharper focus on the petals would have made this a stronger photo.</td>', 'A little more cropped off the right side of the photo, stronger saturation and a sharper focus on the petals would have made this a stronger photo.', '2006-12-08 06:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099206, 434524, 41370, '<td valign="top">I like the sparklies in the background.</td>', 'I like the sparklies in the background.', '2006-12-08 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099224, 434161, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice color, sharp focus and captures the challenge</td>', 'Nice color, sharp focus and captures the challenge', '2006-12-08 07:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099230, 434436, 41370, '<td valign="top">I like the minimalist look and the lighting.</td>', 'I like the minimalist look and the lighting.', '2006-12-08 07:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099232, 434421, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but not the best to capture "life"</td>', 'Nice photo but not the best to capture "life"', '2006-12-08 07:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099234, 435073, 41370, '<td valign="top">One of the best</td>', 'One of the best', '2006-12-08 07:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099238, 435184, 41370, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  A tighter crop around the artist (eliminating the radio) would have made the lighting and color really interesting.  I know it would eliminate the white veil but still it would have been better</td>', 'Nice idea.  A tighter crop around the artist (eliminating the radio) would have made the lighting and color really interesting.  I know it would eliminate the white veil but still it would have been better', '2006-12-08 07:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099333, 433923, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the idea with the pretzel, but the focus is too soft.</td>', 'I like the idea with the pretzel, but the focus is too soft.', '2006-12-08 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099336, 434255, 66597, '<td valign="top">The silhouette is very appealing, as are the shapes of the rocks. There seems to be a black line across the horizon that looks strange, like Photoshop editing that didn''t quite work out.</td>', 'The silhouette is very appealing, as are the shapes of the rocks. There seems to be a black line across the horizon that looks strange, like Photoshop editing that didn''t quite work out.', '2006-12-08 08:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099339, 433823, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think this would be much stronger if just a word or two were in sharp focus. Hard to tell what subject is.</td>', 'I think this would be much stronger if just a word or two were in sharp focus. Hard to tell what subject is.', '2006-12-08 08:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099340, 434639, 66597, '<td valign="top">Wow, great capture. Looks a bit overly sharpened, though.</td>', 'Wow, great capture. Looks a bit overly sharpened, though.', '2006-12-08 08:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099345, 434227, 66597, '<td valign="top">Image looks not quite in focus overall. A closer crop on the rings, or else the rings in a slightly different position might help composition.</td>', 'Image looks not quite in focus overall. A closer crop on the rings, or else the rings in a slightly different position might help composition.', '2006-12-08 08:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099346, 435001, 66597, '<td valign="top">Strong emotive capture. The bicycle wheels add an interesting element as well.</td>', 'Strong emotive capture. The bicycle wheels add an interesting element as well.', '2006-12-08 08:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099352, 434263, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp focus on the seals and emotive.</td>', 'Nice crisp focus on the seals and emotive.', '2006-12-08 08:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099355, 433322, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is Cadillac mountain top in Acadia. Must have been a damn cold photo shoot if so! The composition is strong. The rocks on the bottom left distract for some reason - I think it is that I''d like to either seem them more clearly or not at all.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is Cadillac mountain top in Acadia. Must have been a damn cold photo shoot if so! The composition is strong. The rocks on the bottom left distract for some reason - I think it is that I''d like to either seem them more clearly or not at all.', '2006-12-08 08:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099356, 434194, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the idea a lot. The shell does not quite look in focus, however, and the lighting is a bit flat.</td>', 'I like the idea a lot. The shell does not quite look in focus, however, and the lighting is a bit flat.', '2006-12-08 08:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099359, 434179, 66597, '<td valign="top">The curves are very strong, and color contrast between lily and stem are appealing.</td>', 'The curves are very strong, and color contrast between lily and stem are appealing.', '2006-12-08 08:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099363, 434024, 66597, '<td valign="top">Certainly a very clear, well focused shot with nice DOF. I''m wishing there was something more in the photo, though.</td>', 'Certainly a very clear, well focused shot with nice DOF. I''m wishing there was something more in the photo, though.', '2006-12-08 08:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099366, 435166, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a risky shot - the black on black with just a bit of light on the bud - that really works. My first reaction was "wow".</td>', 'This is a risky shot - the black on black with just a bit of light on the bud - that really works. My first reaction was "wow".', '2006-12-08 08:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099489, 434221, 16241, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, not sure if voters will agree it fits the challenge.<br/>8</td>', 'excellent photo, not sure if voters will agree it fits the challenge.8', '2006-12-08 09:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099673, 433627, 13207, '<td valign="top">This is really neat - the blur of the lights look like a lava flow - was that intentional or just my perception?</td>', 'This is really neat - the blur of the lights look like a lava flow - was that intentional or just my perception?', '2006-12-08 11:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099702, 435244, 50695, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53572" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">xianart</a>... you should really stop using yourself as a model, it makes you too easy to recognize. 7</td>', ' xianart... you should really stop using yourself as a model, it makes you too easy to recognize. 7', '2006-12-08 11:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099704, 434973, 50695, '<td valign="top">7 for concept.</td>', '7 for concept.', '2006-12-08 11:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099794, 434772, 67999, '<td valign="top">how does this apply to the challenge and what does the title have to do with the image?</td>', 'how does this apply to the challenge and what does the title have to do with the image?', '2006-12-08 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099806, 435096, 67999, '<td valign="top">nice concept, i like it, god use of prolonged shutter speed</td>', 'nice concept, i like it, god use of prolonged shutter speed', '2006-12-08 12:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099839, 434031, 67999, '<td valign="top">woah, that is intense, i like the use of 3 eggs with the center one lit up i wonder if the image would have made more of an impact if the egg on the left was lit up...how on earth did you do that?</td>', 'woah, that is intense, i like the use of 3 eggs with the center one lit up i wonder if the image would have made more of an impact if the egg on the left was lit up...how on earth did you do that?', '2006-12-08 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099920, 433758, 66597, '<td valign="top">The colors and simplicity are very appealing, as is the composition with horizon 2/3 down. Would perhaps like to see a bit more detail in the reeds or no reeds at all. 7.</td>', 'The colors and simplicity are very appealing, as is the composition with horizon 2/3 down. Would perhaps like to see a bit more detail in the reeds or no reeds at all. 7.', '2006-12-08 13:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099921, 435160, 66597, '<td valign="top">The colors really pop in this photo, and interesting composition.</td>', 'The colors really pop in this photo, and interesting composition.', '2006-12-08 13:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3099933, 434556, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful juxtaposition between old and new. The colors are very sharp and focus crisp. 9.</td>', 'This is a beautiful juxtaposition between old and new. The colors are very sharp and focus crisp. 9.', '2006-12-08 13:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100062, 434239, 56673, '<td valign="top">Now THIS is a celebration of life!  Great shot.</td>', 'Now THIS is a celebration of life!  Great shot.', '2006-12-08 13:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100123, 435102, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very charming photograph, a magic moment kind of feel.  There''s something about the way her hat kind of chops the composition though that doesn''t feel quite right.</td>', 'Very charming photograph, a magic moment kind of feel.  There''s something about the way her hat kind of chops the composition though that doesn''t feel quite right.', '2006-12-08 14:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100124, 435184, 42100, '<td valign="top">That is the beginnings of some pretty sunning art he''s working on.  I love the technical qualities of this photo, but looking at his back I feel very much on the outside looking in(disconnected in other words).</td>', 'That is the beginnings of some pretty sunning art he''s working on.  I love the technical qualities of this photo, but looking at his back I feel very much on the outside looking in(disconnected in other words).', '2006-12-08 14:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100125, 434491, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a moment, this projects a lot of joy and happiness.  Very, very nice!</td>', 'Great capture of a moment, this projects a lot of joy and happiness.  Very, very nice!', '2006-12-08 14:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100130, 434221, 42100, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and very nice detail.  The darkness and b&amp;w conversion really help with the theme of mood of the phooto.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Strong composition and very nice detail.  The darkness and b&w conversion really help with the theme of mood of the phooto.  Nicely done!', '2006-12-08 14:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100132, 434024, 42100, '<td valign="top">Excellent technicals, a very good stock type of photo.</td>', 'Excellent technicals, a very good stock type of photo.', '2006-12-08 14:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100135, 435232, 42100, '<td valign="top">Good composition and some nicely exposed tones.  Well done!</td>', 'Good composition and some nicely exposed tones.  Well done!', '2006-12-08 14:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100152, 434556, 42100, '<td valign="top">The delicate nature of the hands holding the chick take this to a level beyond just being another cute photo of a baby something or another.  Don''t know if it''s just me or not, but the red in the hands seems to be overly saturated to the point of distracting from the chick.</td>', 'The delicate nature of the hands holding the chick take this to a level beyond just being another cute photo of a baby something or another.  Don''t know if it''s just me or not, but the red in the hands seems to be overly saturated to the point of distracting from the chick.', '2006-12-08 14:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100162, 434639, 42100, '<td valign="top">Dynamic capture with the nearly straight up angle and lots of sky.  Unfortunately it leaves things a little dark on the undersides.  But still a very cool photograph.</td>', 'Dynamic capture with the nearly straight up angle and lots of sky.  Unfortunately it leaves things a little dark on the undersides.  But still a very cool photograph.', '2006-12-08 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100208, 434742, 52439, '<td valign="top">This looks great.<br/>So sharp and naive.</td>', 'This looks great.So sharp and naive.', '2006-12-08 14:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100226, 435154, 55956, '<td valign="top">interesting idea with 2 problems, too in the middle the composition and the bug out of the focus.</td>', 'interesting idea with 2 problems, too in the middle the composition and the bug out of the focus.', '2006-12-08 14:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100239, 434535, 56673, '<td valign="top">Not really a "celebration" of life, IMO.</td>', 'Not really a "celebration" of life, IMO.', '2006-12-08 14:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100243, 434362, 56673, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This a "celebration" of life.</td>', 'Very nice!  This a "celebration" of life.', '2006-12-08 14:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3100254, 434834, 56673, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but execution a little lacking.  Colors seem a little off, focus is a problem, glare off the glass.</td>', 'Good idea, but execution a little lacking.  Colors seem a little off, focus is a problem, glare off the glass.', '2006-12-08 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
