(3100273, 434510, 56673, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  But it''s a little dark and grainy.  The composition perhaps includes too much skyline and not enough of the people who are the subject of the shot.</td>', 'Great idea.  But it''s a little dark and grainy.  The composition perhaps includes too much skyline and not enough of the people who are the subject of the shot.', '2006-12-08 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
