(3101906, 435226, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, what a warm image this is. Well done. The little criticism I can give is about the blown out part of the man''s shirt, since that''s where my eye is drawn. The woman''s right eye, hair, and smile are technically very nice(love that sparkle!), but it''s the overall mood that I really like.</td>', 'Ah, what a warm image this is. Well done. The little criticism I can give is about the blown out part of the man''s shirt, since that''s where my eye is drawn. The woman''s right eye, hair, and smile are technically very nice(love that sparkle!), but it''s the overall mood that I really like.', '2006-12-09 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
