(3101916, 434973, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m giving this a pretty low score, but want to make a comment just to let you know that I respect your effort here. The choice of the baby shop sign behind the cemetery was well found - and the title makes sure the viewer doesn''t miss the meaning. I like that about this entry. The part that made me vote low is the technical quality above all. It feels like it might''ve been shot out a car window. Now that I think about it, maybe the flimmery, out of focus look is what you''re going for. If that''s the case, sorry that it didn''t work for me.</td>', 'I''m giving this a pretty low score, but want to make a comment just to let you know that I respect your effort here. The choice of the baby shop sign behind the cemetery was well found - and the title makes sure the viewer doesn''t miss the meaning. I like that about this entry. The part that made me vote low is the technical quality above all. It feels like it might''ve been shot out a car window. Now that I think about it, maybe the flimmery, out of focus look is what you''re going for. If that''s the case, sorry that it didn''t work for me.', '2006-12-09 08:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101918, 434362, 31133, '<td valign="top">Haha! This is one of the cutest, if not THE cutest entry I''ve viewed so far! What a great, close-up expression! Thanks for the smile.</td>', 'Haha! This is one of the cutest, if not THE cutest entry I''ve viewed so far! What a great, close-up expression! Thanks for the smile.', '2006-12-09 08:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101922, 435221, 31133, '<td valign="top">Two things jump out at me with this - there''s so much going on that I have trouble taking it all in. I think the images in these challenge are easier to rate high if the subjects are very simple. For example, a crop with the window on the left and the church spire alone would''ve given the same message, but in an easier to view way. The second thing that jumps out is that it seems a bit oversharpened, as there seems to be halos around the Route 66 sign and the yellow posts. I like the idea and the title a lot, though!</td>', 'Two things jump out at me with this - there''s so much going on that I have trouble taking it all in. I think the images in these challenge are easier to rate high if the subjects are very simple. For example, a crop with the window on the left and the church spire alone would''ve given the same message, but in an easier to view way. The second thing that jumps out is that it seems a bit oversharpened, as there seems to be halos around the Route 66 sign and the yellow posts. I like the idea and the title a lot, though!', '2006-12-09 08:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101929, 435036, 31133, '<td valign="top">The composition of the flowers and water drops is beautiful. It''s unfortunate that the blown yellows took away the detail in the petals. The colors are very nice. Finally, for me the image would be better if it were cropped to remove the edges of the water container, so only the flowers and the blue parts were visible. Hope you don''t mind my input here. I really do think it''s a nice composition.</td>', 'The composition of the flowers and water drops is beautiful. It''s unfortunate that the blown yellows took away the detail in the petals. The colors are very nice. Finally, for me the image would be better if it were cropped to remove the edges of the water container, so only the flowers and the blue parts were visible. Hope you don''t mind my input here. I really do think it''s a nice composition.', '2006-12-09 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101933, 434194, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think the focus hurts you a bit here, but you''ve probably already received that comment. The idea is great. A bit less centering of the subject would also be an improvement, for my taste at least.</td>', 'I think the focus hurts you a bit here, but you''ve probably already received that comment. The idea is great. A bit less centering of the subject would also be an improvement, for my taste at least.', '2006-12-09 08:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3101935, 435096, 31133, '<td valign="top">All those legs are mesmerizing. I really like this. Almost wish it were only of the bodies with the stripped pavement background - fun entry! The statue looks familiar; I wonder if this is Copenhagen.</td>', 'All those legs are mesmerizing. I really like this. Almost wish it were only of the bodies with the stripped pavement background - fun entry! The statue looks familiar; I wonder if this is Copenhagen.', '2006-12-09 08:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
