(3102233, 434488, 31133, '<td valign="top">What an interesting flower! I can''t imagine what this is... very cool. I think you''ll suffer from the focus on the bee. (at least my score is a little lower because of it) The idea is perfect though and I hope you''ll keep trying to get a shot just like this in perfect focus. Hard to do with those fast-moving insects though, I know from experience :-)</td>', 'What an interesting flower! I can''t imagine what this is... very cool. I think you''ll suffer from the focus on the bee. (at least my score is a little lower because of it) The idea is perfect though and I hope you''ll keep trying to get a shot just like this in perfect focus. Hard to do with those fast-moving insects though, I know from experience :-)', '2006-12-09 12:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
