(3102808, 434556, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ok. . now that my heart has turned to mush, how am I supposed to get anything done!   This is so CUTE!   That little fellow looks so content and safe in those rough, protective hands.   What an emotive shot!  10</td>', 'Ok. . now that my heart has turned to mush, how am I supposed to get anything done!   This is so CUTE!   That little fellow looks so content and safe in those rough, protective hands.   What an emotive shot!  10', '2006-12-09 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
