(3103563, 433904, 5792, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and concept of this image a lot. Depth of field works well. Composition is fine.<br/> <br/>Technical flaws hurt this image. Most noticeable is the haloing, both white and black, along edges of the sharply focused main subject on the left. That is a big distraction. I rarely comment on borders and do not lower scores based on them, but I suspect there are voters that do and will rate this image lower because of it. Your border adds nothing to the composition and is very distracting.</td>', 'Like the idea and concept of this image a lot. Depth of field works well. Composition is fine. Technical flaws hurt this image. Most noticeable is the haloing, both white and black, along edges of the sharply focused main subject on the left. That is a big distraction. I rarely comment on borders and do not lower scores based on them, but I suspect there are voters that do and will rate this image lower because of it. Your border adds nothing to the composition and is very distracting.', '2006-12-10 04:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
