(3103655, 433958, 61155, '<td valign="top">shot would look better rotated 180.</td>', 'shot would look better rotated 180.', '2006-12-10 07:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103657, 433921, 64068, '<td valign="top">Where did you get all these kids from?!! I have one daughter and can''t make her pose for a shot without struggle :) 8</td>', 'Where did you get all these kids from?!! I have one daughter and can''t make her pose for a shot without struggle :) 8', '2006-12-10 07:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103664, 434165, 60987, '<td valign="top">unlike bill his older brother, jack felt flat and a little underdone with his life. :) very creative shot!</td>', 'unlike bill his older brother, jack felt flat and a little underdone with his life. :) very creative shot!', '2006-12-10 07:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103669, 434218, 60987, '<td valign="top">nice creative shot the latex glove doesn''t do it for me. maybe a white cloth type may have worked. very good apart from that. well done.</td>', 'nice creative shot the latex glove doesn''t do it for me. maybe a white cloth type may have worked. very good apart from that. well done.', '2006-12-10 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103709, 435168, 69684, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the dark. It gives a festive atmosphere.</td>', 'I like the light and the dark. It gives a festive atmosphere.', '2006-12-10 08:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103711, 434866, 69684, '<td valign="top">Very nice, would be even better if the horizon was straight.</td>', 'Very nice, would be even better if the horizon was straight.', '2006-12-10 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103801, 433684, 33535, '<td valign="top">cute smile, makes me smiling too :)<br/>the title works well in this case due to the childhood usually being the happiest time in ones life.<br/> <br/>well done, a 7</td>', 'cute smile, makes me smiling too :)the title works well in this case due to the childhood usually being the happiest time in ones life. well done, a 7', '2006-12-10 10:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103859, 434556, 5015, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this could win a ribbon.  Good luck.  Good compisition and photo.  Background colour is complementary to the darker patches on the duckling.</td>', 'In my opinion this could win a ribbon.  Good luck.  Good compisition and photo.  Background colour is complementary to the darker patches on the duckling.', '2006-12-10 11:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103863, 434643, 5015, '<td valign="top">This could get a ribbon in my opinion.  It explodes with life!  Good composition and dof.  The background works well.  I like your interpretation of the subject.  Good luck.</td>', 'This could get a ribbon in my opinion.  It explodes with life!  Good composition and dof.  The background works well.  I like your interpretation of the subject.  Good luck.', '2006-12-10 11:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103866, 435154, 5015, '<td valign="top">In my opinion this could win a ribbon.  I guess it is not a "natural photo" but rather something you set up.  Am I right?  You chose the right colour for the background.  Good lighting and composition.  Good interpretation of the subject.  Good luck</td>', 'In my opinion this could win a ribbon.  I guess it is not a "natural photo" but rather something you set up.  Am I right?  You chose the right colour for the background.  Good lighting and composition.  Good interpretation of the subject.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103874, 434962, 5015, '<td valign="top">I like your photo but I don''t think it will get a ribbon.  Perhaps it is too light - I would have liked it a bit "warmer".  I wonder what would have happened with another angle: say you tak it right from ground level upwards so that you do not get the trees in the background.  You will then only have hay and blue sky with the cute little fellow.  Like your interpretation of the subject.  Overall a good composition.  Good luck</td>', 'I like your photo but I don''t think it will get a ribbon.  Perhaps it is too light - I would have liked it a bit "warmer".  I wonder what would have happened with another angle: say you tak it right from ground level upwards so that you do not get the trees in the background.  You will then only have hay and blue sky with the cute little fellow.  Like your interpretation of the subject.  Overall a good composition.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103883, 433729, 5015, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.  Many may think it is to ordinary - just a rose.  That may be true, but you took a good photo.  Could work a bit on the composition (like adding extra leaves behind the rose).  Just break on or two small branches off and add them for the photo...  I do like your lighting and detail on the rose.  Good luck</td>', 'I like this photo.  Many may think it is to ordinary - just a rose.  That may be true, but you took a good photo.  Could work a bit on the composition (like adding extra leaves behind the rose).  Just break on or two small branches off and add them for the photo...  I do like your lighting and detail on the rose.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103886, 434318, 5015, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the subject, very appropriate title for the photo and overall a good photo.  I like it a lot, but would habe liked the "alive" bit of the photo to be more striking.  I know it would affect the composition, but moving a bit so that your purple flower is closer to the lens and adjusting your DOF could make a difference.  Trying different lighting options could also help.  Have you considered trying the same shot at night?  Good luck.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the subject, very appropriate title for the photo and overall a good photo.  I like it a lot, but would habe liked the "alive" bit of the photo to be more striking.  I know it would affect the composition, but moving a bit so that your purple flower is closer to the lens and adjusting your DOF could make a difference.  Trying different lighting options could also help.  Have you considered trying the same shot at night?  Good luck.', '2006-12-10 11:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103894, 434656, 5015, '<td valign="top">First of all I like this because I am a Christian and I fully believe that He is life.  Luck probably played a role in this, but the different facial expressions are just great.  I like the black and white option.  In colour the photo was probably too busy.  I see the streetlights are slightly slanting to the right.  Use your software and rotate the image one or two degrees to the left.  Then just crop sightly to get it square again.  Good luck</td>', 'First of all I like this because I am a Christian and I fully believe that He is life.  Luck probably played a role in this, but the different facial expressions are just great.  I like the black and white option.  In colour the photo was probably too busy.  I see the streetlights are slightly slanting to the right.  Use your software and rotate the image one or two degrees to the left.  Then just crop sightly to get it square again.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103895, 434742, 5015, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  Good use of black and white.  Perhaps you cropped it a little bit too tight around the ears.  Well done.  Good luck</td>', 'Very good photo.  Good use of black and white.  Perhaps you cropped it a little bit too tight around the ears.  Well done.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103898, 434457, 5015, '<td valign="top">Good photo, good set-up.  Good interpretation of the subject.  You could make the title more applicable to "life" (the subject of the challenge), but I like it anyway.  Good luck</td>', 'Good photo, good set-up.  Good interpretation of the subject.  You could make the title more applicable to "life" (the subject of the challenge), but I like it anyway.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3103902, 434210, 5015, '<td valign="top">Great effect with the grey and green.  Good title, but the photo itself doesn''t jump out at you - if you know what I mean.  Like someone said about my entry:  it lacks that WOW power.  Good luck</td>', 'Great effect with the grey and green.  Good title, but the photo itself doesn''t jump out at you - if you know what I mean.  Like someone said about my entry:  it lacks that WOW power.  Good luck', '2006-12-10 11:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3104087, 435097, 9509, '<td valign="top">I like this picture, but it doesn''t appear to follow the Basic Editing rules, I mean it appears to be two pictures, with the man added to the egg.</td>', 'I like this picture, but it doesn''t appear to follow the Basic Editing rules, I mean it appears to be two pictures, with the man added to the egg.', '2006-12-10 13:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3104088, 435096, 9509, '<td valign="top">great concept...I wonder what the color version would have looked like.  I like it.</td>', 'great concept...I wonder what the color version would have looked like.  I like it.', '2006-12-10 13:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3104089, 434380, 9509, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, it seems a bit dark though.</td>', 'I like the picture, it seems a bit dark though.', '2006-12-10 13:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
