(3104933, 434656, 49773, '<td valign="top">This is the type of photos and scenes I search for. The only remark I have is about the boy to the right of the sign man,being too prominent. If he was more out of focus or in the back it would be just perfect. But you don''t get to choose all the time.</td>', 'This is the type of photos and scenes I search for. The only remark I have is about the boy to the right of the sign man,being too prominent. If he was more out of focus or in the back it would be just perfect. But you don''t get to choose all the time.', '2006-12-10 22:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3104946, 434656, 34938, '<td valign="top">being a Christian Pastor, I love this image for its photojournalistic qualities...an awesome image, great in b and w and great for the challenge...all the best with this 10</td>', 'being a Christian Pastor, I love this image for its photojournalistic qualities...an awesome image, great in b and w and great for the challenge...all the best with this 10', '2006-12-10 22:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
