(3104971, 434024, 34938, '<td valign="top">great image...I like the dof and the composition...sadly, it''s a statement about one of the western world''s epidemic deiseases<br/> <br/>well done 8</td>', 'great image...I like the dof and the composition...sadly, it''s a statement about one of the western world''s epidemic deiseases well done 8', '2006-12-10 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
