(3104981, 434165, 34938, '<td valign="top">over easy is actually when you flip the egg over and cook it a little...this is actually sunny side up...now that we have the technical side out the way, the image is good...the focus isn''t great, but the general idea is ok 6</td>', 'over easy is actually when you flip the egg over and cook it a little...this is actually sunny side up...now that we have the technical side out the way, the image is good...the focus isn''t great, but the general idea is ok 6', '2006-12-10 22:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
