(3105528, 435097, 52449, '<td valign="top">The lighting just doesn''t match up. In the original photo of the person, the sunlight is a bit harsh. However, the eggshell and rubber bands have a softer light. Also, the horizon is not level...is this intentional?</td>', 'The lighting just doesn''t match up. In the original photo of the person, the sunlight is a bit harsh. However, the eggshell and rubber bands have a softer light. Also, the horizon is not level...is this intentional?', '2006-12-11 01:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
