(3107807, 435283, 14476, '<td valign="top">Imaginative and a good fit for the Challenge.  I wonder if it would have been even better with a vertical composition...</td>', 'Imaginative and a good fit for the Challenge.  I wonder if it would have been even better with a vertical composition...', '2006-12-11 21:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107808, 434835, 14476, '<td valign="top">Very well composed and lighted.</td>', 'Very well composed and lighted.', '2006-12-11 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107818, 435097, 14476, '<td valign="top">SUPER idea.  I''d love to see this with a very close crop to the action.</td>', 'SUPER idea.  I''d love to see this with a very close crop to the action.', '2006-12-11 21:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107833, 435114, 14476, '<td valign="top">Re your title - the egg is usually, well really, always, the perogative of the female.  So, this nice queen of life is still nicely composed and well photographed.  I very much like the background. It would be perfect if that sliver of black at the upper left had been covered with the b''ground material.  Keep the good ideas coming.</td>', 'Re your title - the egg is usually, well really, always, the perogative of the female.  So, this nice queen of life is still nicely composed and well photographed.  I very much like the background. It would be perfect if that sliver of black at the upper left had been covered with the b''ground material.  Keep the good ideas coming.', '2006-12-11 21:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107865, 435093, 14476, '<td valign="top">Terrific, a Jim Dine sculpture.  Haven''t seen one of those in waaay too long. I expect Dine would appreciate your juxtaposition of his work, slanted, with the spire you also include.  (Hint:  it also looks pretty darn good the way the artist presented it)  9 because I am so pleased to see it again.  I hope you will tell me where this version exists, later on.</td>', 'Terrific, a Jim Dine sculpture.  Haven''t seen one of those in waaay too long. I expect Dine would appreciate your juxtaposition of his work, slanted, with the spire you also include.  (Hint:  it also looks pretty darn good the way the artist presented it)  9 because I am so pleased to see it again.  I hope you will tell me where this version exists, later on.', '2006-12-11 21:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107869, 433684, 14476, '<td valign="top">Exuberance should be rewarded.  And this is beautifully captured.  8</td>', 'Exuberance should be rewarded.  And this is beautifully captured.  8', '2006-12-11 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107885, 434403, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice alegory.</td>', 'Nice alegory.', '2006-12-11 21:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107910, 434656, 42567, '<td valign="top">Great job on this!  Congratulations</td>', 'Great job on this!  Congratulations', '2006-12-11 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107912, 435114, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cropped way too tight at the top.  You seem a tad bit underexposed as there is no true white on the egg.  Also your white balance seems to be off.<br/>TC</td>', 'Cropped way too tight at the top.  You seem a tad bit underexposed as there is no true white on the egg.  Also your white balance seems to be off.TC', '2006-12-11 22:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107922, 434119, 9906, '<td valign="top">First of all, you have a lovely model here, however, I can not personally appreciate the post processing in this.  It IMHO no longer resembles a photo and has moved beyond into the realm of digital art...<br/>TC</td>', 'First of all, you have a lovely model here, however, I can not personally appreciate the post processing in this.  It IMHO no longer resembles a photo and has moved beyond into the realm of digital art...TC', '2006-12-11 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3107932, 435236, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice in it''s simplicity!  If it were only possible to get a little more catch light in her eye!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice in it''s simplicity!  If it were only possible to get a little more catch light in her eye!TC', '2006-12-11 22:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108156, 435033, 64462, '<td valign="top">OMG!</td>', 'OMG!', '2006-12-12 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108163, 434866, 64462, '<td valign="top">very much like librodo''s recent ribbon-winner shot.</td>', 'very much like librodo''s recent ribbon-winner shot.', '2006-12-12 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108214, 434866, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great concept, nice capture, water on left looks great, good shadows. This can be a very, very good image.<br/> <br/>Imporvements: As I''m sure has been mentioned numerous times, you need to level the horizon. The water reflection on the right is overexposed and you want to do color processing to bring out dramatic color in the sky or convert image to standard black and white.</td>', 'Great concept, nice capture, water on left looks great, good shadows. This can be a very, very good image. Imporvements: As I''m sure has been mentioned numerous times, you need to level the horizon. The water reflection on the right is overexposed and you want to do color processing to bring out dramatic color in the sky or convert image to standard black and white.', '2006-12-12 00:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108234, 434296, 66635, '<td valign="top">Amazing Shot!  Not sure about the celebration aspect of the challenge, but an amazing shot.</td>', 'Amazing Shot!  Not sure about the celebration aspect of the challenge, but an amazing shot.', '2006-12-12 01:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108241, 435314, 66635, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  Neat lighting.  I''d score it higher if I could see the celebratory aspect.</td>', 'Cool idea.  Neat lighting.  I''d score it higher if I could see the celebratory aspect.', '2006-12-12 01:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108310, 435303, 66635, '<td valign="top">Man, that guy on the right looks like John Lennon.  Cool picture, but not sure of the celebratory aspect.</td>', 'Man, that guy on the right looks like John Lennon.  Cool picture, but not sure of the celebratory aspect.', '2006-12-12 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108328, 434524, 66635, '<td valign="top">Incredible shot.  Love the colors and the crisp clarity - especially in the water beads.  I would score it a 10 if it were not for my inability to really see a celebratory aspect to it.</td>', 'Incredible shot.  Love the colors and the crisp clarity - especially in the water beads.  I would score it a 10 if it were not for my inability to really see a celebratory aspect to it.', '2006-12-12 01:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
