(3108372, 434362, 66097, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh in a good way... one of favorite characer type of dogs. It made me tear up thinkging of my English Springer and German Shepard that both passed at 14 years old. I miss them so much. This one looks like he/she could be a lot of fun... <br/>I think you captured the character quite well.  I am not good enough to comment on technical the technical aspects at this time.</td>', 'This made me laugh in a good way... one of favorite characer type of dogs. It made me tear up thinkging of my English Springer and German Shepard that both passed at 14 years old. I miss them so much. This one looks like he/she could be a lot of fun... I think you captured the character quite well.  I am not good enough to comment on technical the technical aspects at this time.', '2006-12-12 02:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108374, 434491, 66097, '<td valign="top">Very nice.... you captured the emotion. The lighting is not bad.  Good crop.</td>', 'Very nice.... you captured the emotion. The lighting is not bad.  Good crop.', '2006-12-12 02:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
