(3108802, 435001, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Even more so if it is a true candid. It is nice to find the kid in people no matter how old. 7 for now. OK - I am back. I was watching my wife vote in this challenge and your image came up. I knew I liked it the first couple of times I viewed it but with a day or two away from it and then seeing it again it really just struck me how much I really like it alot. So on that note - double bump and added to my faves.</td>', 'Great capture. Even more so if it is a true candid. It is nice to find the kid in people no matter how old. 7 for now. OK - I am back. I was watching my wife vote in this challenge and your image came up. I knew I liked it the first couple of times I viewed it but with a day or two away from it and then seeing it again it really just struck me how much I really like it alot. So on that note - double bump and added to my faves.', '2006-12-12 08:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108803, 434535, 68256, '<td valign="top">I don''t get your interpretation but I hate to count off because I can''t figure it out....I''m giving this a 4 because it has nothing that interests me in it.  I do like the smoothness and the glares add a little something...  I can''t tell if it is in focus or not either because I don''t know what I''m looking at.  I''m sorry for the somewhat low vote and hope you are ok with my weak explanation of why.</td>', 'I don''t get your interpretation but I hate to count off because I can''t figure it out....I''m giving this a 4 because it has nothing that interests me in it.  I do like the smoothness and the glares add a little something...  I can''t tell if it is in focus or not either because I don''t know what I''m looking at.  I''m sorry for the somewhat low vote and hope you are ok with my weak explanation of why.', '2006-12-12 08:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108805, 434380, 68197, '<td valign="top">The heart of the matter captured.</td>', 'The heart of the matter captured.', '2006-12-12 08:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108807, 434656, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured. My top pick for the challenge. You may have cropped a bit off the top and still had a good composition - would have removed some of the brightness. But overall excellent. Oh yes - and He is! Back one more time. I want to see this image on the front page pretty bad. Bumping up to a 10 and adding to my faves. Well done!</td>', 'Very nicely captured. My top pick for the challenge. You may have cropped a bit off the top and still had a good composition - would have removed some of the brightness. But overall excellent. Oh yes - and He is! Back one more time. I want to see this image on the front page pretty bad. Bumping up to a 10 and adding to my faves. Well done!', '2006-12-12 08:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108812, 434556, 53147, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, pleasant colors and a cute little (non rubber) ducky. Bumping up 1.</td>', 'Lovely image, pleasant colors and a cute little (non rubber) ducky. Bumping up 1.', '2006-12-12 08:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108813, 434742, 68197, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and sharpness of the subject anf the soft background is just right to keep the portrait to the foreground. Wow!</td>', 'Nice detail and sharpness of the subject anf the soft background is just right to keep the portrait to the foreground. Wow!', '2006-12-12 08:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108816, 435183, 68197, '<td valign="top">Just a liitle more work on the upper third of the picture to enhance its exposure might be beneficial. Nice view!</td>', 'Just a liitle more work on the upper third of the picture to enhance its exposure might be beneficial. Nice view!', '2006-12-12 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108817, 433797, 68256, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I couldn''t go above 4 on this.  The background is so distracting and clashes with the cute baby so much....It kinda looks like a baby was plopped down on a kitchen table cloth and a snapshot was taken.  Sorry for the harsh comment but I wanted you to know why I voted 4. In my opinion the baby doesn''t engage the viewer because she is looking up and away from the camera.  Also the tight crop doesn''t work for me.  I think it would have helped greatly to have the baby more upright and with a more muted background.  One other thing, the upper corners are distracting because the backdrop wasn''t big enough.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I couldn''t go above 4 on this.  The background is so distracting and clashes with the cute baby so much....It kinda looks like a baby was plopped down on a kitchen table cloth and a snapshot was taken.  Sorry for the harsh comment but I wanted you to know why I voted 4. In my opinion the baby doesn''t engage the viewer because she is looking up and away from the camera.  Also the tight crop doesn''t work for me.  I think it would have helped greatly to have the baby more upright and with a more muted background.  One other thing, the upper corners are distracting because the backdrop wasn''t big enough.', '2006-12-12 08:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108819, 434221, 68197, '<td valign="top">So much to ponder here! I like the depth of field!</td>', 'So much to ponder here! I like the depth of field!', '2006-12-12 08:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108820, 434603, 68197, '<td valign="top">Just a bit overly sharpened and saurated for my taste.</td>', 'Just a bit overly sharpened and saurated for my taste.', '2006-12-12 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108822, 434074, 68197, '<td valign="top">All colors and depths well represented. Well done!</td>', 'All colors and depths well represented. Well done!', '2006-12-12 08:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108826, 435316, 69835, '<td valign="top">I think this is very creative and also a little funny. You got my vote.</td>', 'I think this is very creative and also a little funny. You got my vote.', '2006-12-12 08:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108829, 434933, 68197, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait framed left with the backgroung adding a dimension as to how the subject may be interpreted.</td>', 'I like the portrait framed left with the backgroung adding a dimension as to how the subject may be interpreted.', '2006-12-12 08:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108835, 434853, 68197, '<td valign="top">Good placement of subject within the picture.</td>', 'Good placement of subject within the picture.', '2006-12-12 08:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108837, 434488, 68197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps would polish up with a bit of sharpening? Maybe my eyes are just getting old!</td>', 'Perhaps would polish up with a bit of sharpening? Maybe my eyes are just getting old!', '2006-12-12 08:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108843, 435300, 68197, '<td valign="top">Appears a tad over-exposed, losing some of the texture. But a bright beginning!</td>', 'Appears a tad over-exposed, losing some of the texture. But a bright beginning!', '2006-12-12 08:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108847, 433960, 68197, '<td valign="top">I enjot the dimishing  subject sizes in this perspective view.</td>', 'I enjot the dimishing  subject sizes in this perspective view.', '2006-12-12 08:35:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3108848, 433018, 68256, '<td valign="top">There is a simple beauty to this that I love.  My 10 comes not from the content (which I greatly appreciate) but the composition, lighting and framing.  You did an excellent job and I hope other voters (that don''t like the content) will see past that and vote on the photo itself.</td>', 'There is a simple beauty to this that I love.  My 10 comes not from the content (which I greatly appreciate) but the composition, lighting and framing.  You did an excellent job and I hope other voters (that don''t like the content) will see past that and vote on the photo itself.', '2006-12-12 08:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108849, 435279, 68197, '<td valign="top">This could be a birthday card at the store!</td>', 'This could be a birthday card at the store!', '2006-12-12 08:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108851, 435303, 68197, '<td valign="top">Strong vertical line study.</td>', 'Strong vertical line study.', '2006-12-12 08:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108853, 435005, 68197, '<td valign="top">Life is colorful, indeed. Nice display of colors, the man does not detract from the ballons.</td>', 'Life is colorful, indeed. Nice display of colors, the man does not detract from the ballons.', '2006-12-12 08:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108855, 434866, 68256, '<td valign="top">This is really nice...I think I would have voted 10 instead of 9 if the horizon was level and the jumpers were a little more centered.  That may not have been possible because of the bright sun however.  Great photo.</td>', 'This is really nice...I think I would have voted 10 instead of 9 if the horizon was level and the jumpers were a little more centered.  That may not have been possible because of the bright sun however.  Great photo.', '2006-12-12 08:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108858, 434421, 68197, '<td valign="top">The colrs at night are attractive and the horizontal motion seems to detract.</td>', 'The colrs at night are attractive and the horizontal motion seems to detract.', '2006-12-12 08:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108859, 433347, 68197, '<td valign="top">Well done! captures the emotion!</td>', 'Well done! captures the emotion!', '2006-12-12 08:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108861, 435282, 69792, '<td valign="top">very nice shot, i really like your idea..</td>', 'very nice shot, i really like your idea..', '2006-12-12 08:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108864, 434067, 68197, '<td valign="top">I am struggling a bit with something here: the horizon line at mid-picture? the foreground usurping the sunset?</td>', 'I am struggling a bit with something here: the horizon line at mid-picture? the foreground usurping the sunset?', '2006-12-12 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108865, 435255, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very good feeling in this picture.  I voted 9 and not 10 because of 2 things.  First the hands look "masculine" to me and contrast (not in lighting but feeling) with the rest of the body.  It almost looks like jpeg artifacts around the hand or something.  Second the white line going from her right forearm down is a little to noticable.  That is it...otherwise a perfect 10.</td>', 'Very good feeling in this picture.  I voted 9 and not 10 because of 2 things.  First the hands look "masculine" to me and contrast (not in lighting but feeling) with the rest of the body.  It almost looks like jpeg artifacts around the hand or something.  Second the white line going from her right forearm down is a little to noticable.  That is it...otherwise a perfect 10.', '2006-12-12 08:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108867, 434937, 68197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps just a littlle shallower DOF would enhance this great capture.</td>', 'Perhaps just a littlle shallower DOF would enhance this great capture.', '2006-12-12 08:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108870, 434291, 68197, '<td valign="top">Perhaps cropping the left side in a bit would enhance the portrait.</td>', 'Perhaps cropping the left side in a bit would enhance the portrait.', '2006-12-12 08:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108872, 433797, 68197, '<td valign="top">Reducing the overexposure at the top left might enhance the subject.</td>', 'Reducing the overexposure at the top left might enhance the subject.', '2006-12-12 08:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108875, 434264, 68197, '<td valign="top">Appears "too compunded together", if that is helpful.</td>', 'Appears "too compunded together", if that is helpful.', '2006-12-12 08:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108876, 435234, 68197, '<td valign="top">A Hallmark moment! Well done!</td>', 'A Hallmark moment! Well done!', '2006-12-12 08:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108877, 434436, 68197, '<td valign="top">Well done all around!</td>', 'Well done all around!', '2006-12-12 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108880, 435008, 68197, '<td valign="top">When I crop up from the bottom, eliminating the from trapezius line dowm, I find a slight enhancement to the portrait.</td>', 'When I crop up from the bottom, eliminating the from trapezius line dowm, I find a slight enhancement to the portrait.', '2006-12-12 08:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108886, 434528, 68197, '<td valign="top">The left sky detracts a bit from the nice contrast in colors of the main subject. I don''t know how to handle that.</td>', 'The left sky detracts a bit from the nice contrast in colors of the main subject. I don''t know how to handle that.', '2006-12-12 08:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108890, 434024, 68197, '<td valign="top">Recovering some of the texture in the very most foreground white cap might enhance.</td>', 'Recovering some of the texture in the very most foreground white cap might enhance.', '2006-12-12 08:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108891, 433684, 68197, '<td valign="top">A great gesture captured!</td>', 'A great gesture captured!', '2006-12-12 08:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108892, 435096, 68197, '<td valign="top">Conveys the title well.</td>', 'Conveys the title well.', '2006-12-12 08:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3108897, 434318, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail of the thistles, but the background is rather busy and the yseem to get lost.</td>', 'Nice color and detail of the thistles, but the background is rather busy and the yseem to get lost.', '2006-12-12 09:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109047, 434973, 42100, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the gravestones against the baby store, life beginning vs. life ending.  I imagine it''s the low light that caused the unsteady hand.  If you''re comfortable with it you could of used a tombstone to prop the camera against to help steady it.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the gravestones against the baby store, life beginning vs. life ending.  I imagine it''s the low light that caused the unsteady hand.  If you''re comfortable with it you could of used a tombstone to prop the camera against to help steady it.', '2006-12-12 10:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109054, 435229, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but too much noise reduction applied causing detail loss.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but too much noise reduction applied causing detail loss.', '2006-12-12 10:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109114, 434866, 56978, '<td valign="top">top spot for me</td>', 'top spot for me', '2006-12-12 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109124, 434221, 28532, '<td valign="top">All I can say is WOW!!! (and adding to favs)</td>', 'All I can say is WOW!!! (and adding to favs)', '2006-12-12 11:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109131, 434508, 28532, '<td valign="top">This is very cool!  I really like the tones - it gives it a bit of a classy feel and not the typical holiday gimmicky feel - very nice!!</td>', 'This is very cool!  I really like the tones - it gives it a bit of a classy feel and not the typical holiday gimmicky feel - very nice!!', '2006-12-12 11:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3109134, 434772, 28532, '<td valign="top">Great shot - makes you think and wonder what''s happened ...there is a story here.  Awesome!!</td>', 'Great shot - makes you think and wonder what''s happened ...there is a story here.  Awesome!!', '2006-12-12 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
