(3110698, 434933, 69832, '<td valign="top">Good motif and colours: life bare of urban luxuries, but full of hard rural labour. The expression on her face is well caught. However, her face is under-exposed with too much darkness above her eyes (and below the blue sholder line of her sweater). A good setting and POV - foggy morning somewhere in the countryside, a wooden fence along a dirt road leading to some hut - the whole composition tells the story well.</td>', 'Good motif and colours: life bare of urban luxuries, but full of hard rural labour. The expression on her face is well caught. However, her face is under-exposed with too much darkness above her eyes (and below the blue sholder line of her sweater). A good setting and POV - foggy morning somewhere in the countryside, a wooden fence along a dirt road leading to some hut - the whole composition tells the story well.', '2006-12-12 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110704, 435317, 69832, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I am trying to guess: a microscopic image of a human egg? But then a 3/4 halo around it, the whole thing in blue against black, like the planet earth in the universe. Am not quite sure what I am looking at here. Still, I like the composition and colour combination.</td>', 'Hmmm, I am trying to guess: a microscopic image of a human egg? But then a 3/4 halo around it, the whole thing in blue against black, like the planet earth in the universe. Am not quite sure what I am looking at here. Still, I like the composition and colour combination.', '2006-12-12 23:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110732, 434024, 69832, '<td valign="top">It looks like a ''clinical'' image. The title is needed, though, to understand the purpose of the medication ''portrayed''. Motiv, subdued colours, the cool  plain background, and composition indicate a life depending on medicine, a life we don''t like. But still, this is life too. And those in need of ''Humalog'' have no choice, it is their life-support.<br/>Composition: Subjcet off-centre, simple, clear lines, one vertical on the LH side, one diagonal from RH side to lower LH corner. Good DOF with end of the syringe, i.e. instrument/action, blurred. Very thoughtfully created composition.</td>', 'It looks like a ''clinical'' image. The title is needed, though, to understand the purpose of the medication ''portrayed''. Motiv, subdued colours, the cool  plain background, and composition indicate a life depending on medicine, a life we don''t like. But still, this is life too. And those in need of ''Humalog'' have no choice, it is their life-support.Composition: Subjcet off-centre, simple, clear lines, one vertical on the LH side, one diagonal from RH side to lower LH corner. Good DOF with end of the syringe, i.e. instrument/action, blurred. Very thoughtfully created composition.', '2006-12-12 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110734, 435096, 3214, '<td valign="top">Terrific!  City Life.</td>', 'Terrific!  City Life.', '2006-12-12 23:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110736, 434239, 3214, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful expression of the theme!  A favorite.</td>', 'What a wonderful expression of the theme!  A favorite.', '2006-12-12 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110738, 434742, 3214, '<td valign="top">wow, this does express "life" to me.  Hope nobody picks her off.</td>', 'wow, this does express "life" to me.  Hope nobody picks her off.', '2006-12-12 23:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110739, 433018, 69832, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, simple composition with strong colours. Death is part of life, so IMO this is a good illustration of the subject of this competition. The crosses are well-positioned off-centre, indicating a triangle reaching both down into the ground and up into the sky. Very effective.</td>', 'Beautiful, simple composition with strong colours. Death is part of life, so IMO this is a good illustration of the subject of this competition. The crosses are well-positioned off-centre, indicating a triangle reaching both down into the ground and up into the sky. Very effective.', '2006-12-12 23:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110753, 435162, 56756, '<td valign="top">Right on!!</td>', 'Right on!!', '2006-12-12 23:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110755, 435033, 56756, '<td valign="top">A bit graphic but hey...thats life-i know, bad choice of words. :D</td>', 'A bit graphic but hey...thats life-i know, bad choice of words. :D', '2006-12-12 23:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110758, 434291, 69832, '<td valign="top">Young human life, a well-caught moment. A pity about the nasty flash, though, it spoils the colours. A snapshot alright, but the in-camera compostion is not good: apart from her hand on his (under-exposed) shoulder, there are too many details in the lower third o the picture.</td>', 'Young human life, a well-caught moment. A pity about the nasty flash, though, it spoils the colours. A snapshot alright, but the in-camera compostion is not good: apart from her hand on his (under-exposed) shoulder, there are too many details in the lower third o the picture.', '2006-12-12 23:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110760, 435331, 69832, '<td valign="top">Green is life, water is life, roots are life, plants are life, round is life - I like the motifs used to illustrate the subject of this competition. Good tone-in-tone composition, nice details. A good crop.</td>', 'Green is life, water is life, roots are life, plants are life, round is life - I like the motifs used to illustrate the subject of this competition. Good tone-in-tone composition, nice details. A good crop.', '2006-12-12 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110762, 435316, 69093, '<td valign="top">love it!</td>', 'love it!', '2006-12-12 23:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110769, 434962, 69832, '<td valign="top">Good composition with the diagonal line of the straw (?) separating FG from BG. Children are life, harvest is life, nature is life, clouds are life -well illustrated topic. The FG seems a bit under-exposed and so does the child. Also, I would have cropped another 20% off the bottom part.</td>', 'Good composition with the diagonal line of the straw (?) separating FG from BG. Children are life, harvest is life, nature is life, clouds are life -well illustrated topic. The FG seems a bit under-exposed and so does the child. Also, I would have cropped another 20% off the bottom part.', '2006-12-12 23:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110773, 435170, 69832, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, creative idea of illustrating the topic of this composition. Simple, effective. The cracked egg is well-placed off-centre, the baby has already gone, walked into life, we just see its ''foot prints'', heading off in a diagonal direction. Well done!</td>', 'Very sweet, creative idea of illustrating the topic of this composition. Simple, effective. The cracked egg is well-placed off-centre, the baby has already gone, walked into life, we just see its ''foot prints'', heading off in a diagonal direction. Well done!', '2006-12-12 23:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110775, 434556, 69832, '<td valign="top">A new life sits well protected in old hands. Lovely colours and a wonder-ful composition.</td>', 'A new life sits well protected in old hands. Lovely colours and a wonder-ful composition.', '2006-12-12 23:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110779, 435102, 69832, '<td valign="top">The girl: She looks so innocent, beautiful and trusting, her smile and eyes are most radiant. She must be enjoying her life and looking forward to the future. I wish her a happy future and the bit of luck always needed to make dreams come true.<br/>The photograph: Good contrast of shades, the brown tones around her face make it still more vibrant. It is exquisite. The viewer connects right to the subject because she seems to be looking into his/her eyes.</td>', 'The girl: She looks so innocent, beautiful and trusting, her smile and eyes are most radiant. She must be enjoying her life and looking forward to the future. I wish her a happy future and the bit of luck always needed to make dreams come true.The photograph: Good contrast of shades, the brown tones around her face make it still more vibrant. It is exquisite. The viewer connects right to the subject because she seems to be looking into his/her eyes.', '2006-12-12 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3110780, 435211, 69832, '<td valign="top">Green means life, water means life, so I find this well chosen to illustrate the topic of this competition. Nice positioning off centre with different shades of green. Judging from looking at it on <i>my </i>screen it could be a tad bit sharper. I like the soft beige brown colour of the background and the water dripping down in the FG. I am wondering, though, whether this is taken from behind a glass pane because it seems a bit foggy.</td>', 'Green means life, water means life, so I find this well chosen to illustrate the topic of this competition. Nice positioning off centre with different shades of green. Judging from looking at it on my screen it could be a tad bit sharper. I like the soft beige brown colour of the background and the water dripping down in the FG. I am wondering, though, whether this is taken from behind a glass pane because it seems a bit foggy.', '2006-12-12 23:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
