(3111280, 434510, 45475, '<td valign="top">Thanks for that Nick! Way to inflate a girl''s ego! :) I honestly believe this image truly deserved a much higher placing though. It''s not just a picture of something, shot solely as a passing thought, but like a carefully sculpted masterpiece. All the elements strategically placed by an artist to tell a story. Wish I was blessed with your vision and wish other people would try to look a bit harder too sometimes...</td>', 'Thanks for that Nick! Way to inflate a girl''s ego! :) I honestly believe this image truly deserved a much higher placing though. It''s not just a picture of something, shot solely as a passing thought, but like a carefully sculpted masterpiece. All the elements strategically placed by an artist to tell a story. Wish I was blessed with your vision and wish other people would try to look a bit harder too sometimes...', '2006-12-13 01:20:10.000000', NULL, 0),
