(3112241, 435246, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by agenkin:</b></div><hr/><i> This is musical.  You placed the light squiggle into the lower left corner, but the squiggle attracts a lot of attention.  I wish you found another spot in the frame for such accent. 7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree, but this shot was an accident. As it is, you just have to accept that it is an extremely low note. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by agenkin: This is musical.  You placed the light squiggle into the lower left corner, but the squiggle attracts a lot of attention.  I wish you found another spot in the frame for such accent. 7   I agree, but this shot was an accident. As it is, you just have to accept that it is an extremely low note. :)', '2006-12-13 08:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
