(3112281, 433322, 68514, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by noraneko:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m guessing this is Cadillac mountain top in Acadia. Must have been a damn cold photo shoot if so! The composition is strong. The rocks on the bottom left distract for some reason - I think it is that I''d like to either seem them more clearly or not at all. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''m sorry, but this is the top of Mount Pizzoc, in Italy, 80 km north of Venice. Thank for your comment :)</td>', 'Originally posted by noraneko: I''m guessing this is Cadillac mountain top in Acadia. Must have been a damn cold photo shoot if so! The composition is strong. The rocks on the bottom left distract for some reason - I think it is that I''d like to either seem them more clearly or not at all.  I''m sorry, but this is the top of Mount Pizzoc, in Italy, 80 km north of Venice. Thank for your comment :)', '2006-12-13 09:02:40.000000', NULL, 0),
