(3112918, 434535, 65592, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments, all them are very helpful and will help me to improve. I especially appreciate jasonlprice comments, thank you for your sincerity. Hope the following explanation clarify a little my entry.<br/>I realize that my idea for this challenge was quite abstract, water as basis of life. The human body is 70% of water, the first thing that we look for in other planets to find out if life was or is possible is water,etc<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for your comments, all them are very helpful and will help me to improve. I especially appreciate jasonlprice comments, thank you for your sincerity. Hope the following explanation clarify a little my entry.I realize that my idea for this challenge was quite abstract, water as basis of life. The human body is 70% of water, the first thing that we look for in other planets to find out if life was or is possible is water,etc', '2006-12-13 11:30:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3112933, 435246, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oh my gosh. I almost spoiled you brown ribbon. I gave this a 9. I really like the colors and the way the dark area on the bottom mirrors the power lines. I had no idea what that bright worm was, but the bright spot of color was key to the composition. This must have been really fun for you reading all the comments. Congratulations on meeting your goal.</td>', 'Oh my gosh. I almost spoiled you brown ribbon. I gave this a 9. I really like the colors and the way the dark area on the bottom mirrors the power lines. I had no idea what that bright worm was, but the bright spot of color was key to the composition. This must have been really fun for you reading all the comments. Congratulations on meeting your goal.', '2006-12-13 11:33:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3112983, 434630, 68256, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all who took the time to comment.  For those who thought the picture was snapshotish and boring, I would also like to say thanks.  Don''t ever be afraid to be critical because that helps someone trying to learn very much.<br/> <br/>Funny about the grandma comment kawana, I didn''t even think about it until you said that.  The sweater that my daughter has on does look "old fashion" huh?<br/> <br/>Gordon your comment was especially helpful and probably the reason for the lack of WOW.  I think you are right on about the background. <br/> <br/>Nudibranch, thank you also for the specific recommendation.</td>', 'Thank you to all who took the time to comment.  For those who thought the picture was snapshotish and boring, I would also like to say thanks.  Don''t ever be afraid to be critical because that helps someone trying to learn very much. Funny about the grandma comment kawana, I didn''t even think about it until you said that.  The sweater that my daughter has on does look "old fashion" huh? Gordon your comment was especially helpful and probably the reason for the lack of WOW.  I think you are right on about the background.  Nudibranch, thank you also for the specific recommendation.', '2006-12-13 11:44:33.000000', NULL, 0),
