(3117147, 434221, 66635, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by xantangummi:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gmicuga:</b></div><hr/><i> Yes it is my picture , the place is near my house and i have repeated the shoot in the challenge time. You can see my nick on photosig its the same like here. Understend people!!!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Great job in getting the cloud formations exactly the same as last month :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, pretty clear.  You gave in to temptation. Not possible for the clouds to be the same.  Also, all the wrinkles in your shirt are exactly the same.  Didn''t have anything to do with the challenge, anyway.</td>', 'Originally posted by xantangummi: Originally posted by Gmicuga: Yes it is my picture , the place is near my house and i have repeated the shoot in the challenge time. You can see my nick on photosig its the same like here. Understend people!!!!   Great job in getting the cloud formations exactly the same as last month :D   Yeah, pretty clear.  You gave in to temptation. Not possible for the clouds to be the same.  Also, all the wrinkles in your shirt are exactly the same.  Didn''t have anything to do with the challenge, anyway.', '2006-12-14 12:00:22.000000', NULL, 0),
