(3202832, 435285, 12268, '<td valign="top">Hey Hey!<br/>Teammate Rooster here!<br/> <br/>This was a risky shot &amp; I''m glad you took it! Screw the score, creatively this was a great shot. <br/>Some quick thoughts:<br/>THe colours are deep here &amp; contrast very well. I''m really feelin'' it. I also love the title. Very appropriate. The crop is nice as well. The focus seems a bit off tho &amp; I think USM would have kicked this shot up.<br/>Good stuff dude!<br/>Peace<br/>Rooster</td>', 'Hey Hey!Teammate Rooster here! This was a risky shot & I''m glad you took it! Screw the score, creatively this was a great shot. Some quick thoughts:THe colours are deep here & contrast very well. I''m really feelin'' it. I also love the title. Very appropriate. The crop is nice as well. The focus seems a bit off tho & I think USM would have kicked this shot up.Good stuff dude!PeaceRooster', '2007-01-10 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 0),
