(4079693, 433765, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  Not bad.  There seems to be a cast to the picture, although the warmth doesn''t hurt the picture.  The composition isn''t bad, although I wonder what a vertical treatment would do to the shot.  One possibility would have been to shoot with a longer lens so the DOF is deeper which gives the shadow more of a sharp delineation.  Again, I''d have to see it though to know if it improves things.<br/> <br/>Feel: A cute cat shot.  I do get the curiosity feel.<br/> <br/>The game:  Ya, DNMC, I guess.  At least it doesn''t scream "celebrate life" to me...</td>', 'Technicals:  Not bad.  There seems to be a cast to the picture, although the warmth doesn''t hurt the picture.  The composition isn''t bad, although I wonder what a vertical treatment would do to the shot.  One possibility would have been to shoot with a longer lens so the DOF is deeper which gives the shadow more of a sharp delineation.  Again, I''d have to see it though to know if it improves things. Feel: A cute cat shot.  I do get the curiosity feel. The game:  Ya, DNMC, I guess.  At least it doesn''t scream "celebrate life" to me...', '2007-09-10 23:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
